  <para style="h">Korinto1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Korinto bi 1</para>
  <para style="toc2">Korinto 1</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kor1</para>
  <para style="mt1">Korinto bi 1</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Paulo, nɔ nɛ Mawu tsɛ kɛ ha Yesu Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi ɔ, kɛ wa nyɛmi Sostene nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />kɛ mane Mawu asafohi nɛ ngɛ Korinto ɔ. A ji nihi nɛ Mawu tsɛ kaa e bimɛ nɛ e tsukɔ a he ngɛ Kristo mi. A kɛ womi nɛ ɔ mane nihi tsuo hu nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ waa kɛ mɛ tsɛɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Jɔɔmi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ tsuo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu jɔɔ mo, koo je he nɔ́</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />I naa Mawu si daa ngɛ dloomi nike ni agbohi nɛ e ngɔ ha nyɛ ngɛ Kristo nihi nɛ nyɛ ji ɔ he. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />E pee nyɛ ni nali ngɛ nyɛ wami be kulaa mi, nɛ e ye kɛ bua nyɛ ngɛ e he munyu tumi kɛ tsɔɔmi kɛ ni lemi tsuo mi. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Nɛ nɔ́ nɛ i de nyɛ kaa Kristo ma tsu ha nyɛ ɔ, e ba mi. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ nine su dloomi kɛ jɔɔmi kɛ mumi mi nike ni kɛ he wami nɔ, ejakaa nyɛ tsu e suɔmi nya ni be mi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo bami ekohu ɔ blɔ hyɛe ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nɛ lɛ nɔuu e maa da nyɛ se kpɛii kɛ ya nyagbe konɛ yayami kɛ fɔ bumi ko nɛ ko hi nyɛ he ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo bami ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Anɔkualetsɛ ji Mawu nɛ e maa pee enɛ ɔ ha nyɛ, ejakaa e yeɔ e si womi nɔ, nɛ lɛ nɔuu ji nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ba e kɛ e Bi wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo huɛ bɔmi ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Se, anyɛmimɛ suɔli, i kpa nyɛ pɛɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi kaa nyɛ kpa nya sami, nɛ nyɛ ha kake peemi nɛ hi nyɛ kpɛti ngɛ juɛmi kɛ níhi a he susumi mi konɛ mi gbami nɛ ko ba asafo ɔ mi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ejakaa, anyɛmimɛ suɔli, Kloe we ɔ mi bi komɛ ba de mi nya sami kɛ pɛ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ nɔ́ kpa dee. Ni komɛ ke, “Ami lɛɛ Paulo se nyɛɛlɔ ji mi”; nɛ ni komɛ hu de ke, “Ami lɛɛ Apolo nɔ́ ji mi”; aloo “Ami lɛɛ Petro nɔ́ ji mi.” Nɛ ni komɛ hu ngɛ dee ke, “Ami lɛɛ Kristo nitsɛ nɔ́ ji mi.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ gba Kristo mi tsɔwitsɔwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 1:13">Anɛ ami Paulo ji nɔ nɛ gbo ngɛ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ a he lo? Anɛ Paulo biɛ mi nɛ a baptisi nyɛ ngɔ wo lo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />I naa Mawu si kaa i baptisi we nyɛ ti nɔ ko, kaa ja Krispo kɛ Gaio pɛ; <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />konɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko de ke i ngɛ nɔ́ ko he pee aloo i je “Paulo Asafo” sisi. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Nɛ i baptisi Stefana weku ɔ hu, se kɛ je lɔ ɔ se ɔ, i kai we kaa i baptisi nɔ kpa ko hu. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ejakaa Kristo tsɔɛ mi kaa ma ba baptisi nihi. Se mohu ma ba fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ; pi ngɛ ni lemi nya, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ko ha nɛ Kristo Sɛumi tso ɔ he sane ɔ nɛ pee gu.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />I Le klɛdɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ji kuasia sane kɛ ha nihi nɛ laa blɔ ɔ, ke a de mɛ ke Kristo gbo nɛ e kɛ he a yi wami ɔ. Se wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a he wa yi wami ɔ, wa yo munyu nɛ ɔ kaa e ji Mawu he wami. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ejakaa Mawu de ke, “Ma puɛ adesa yi wami hemi he blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ tsuo, bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ juɛmi ngɛ mi ha, nɛ i be ga leli ɔmɛ a ga amɛ tue bue, ke a hi saminya tete po.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Jije ni leli ɔmɛ kɛ womi mi leli kpanaa amɛ kɛ je nɛ ɔ mi munyu mi hlali agbo ɔmɛ ngɛ? Mawu ha nɛ mɛ tsuo a plɛ kuasiahi nɛ a ni lemi pee ni lemi gu. <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Ejakaa ngɛ Mawu nile nya a, e ha we he blɔ kaa je ɔ nɛ gu nɔmlɔ ni lemi nɔ kɛ le lɛ. Nɛ enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e he nihi kulaa nɛ he e munyu ɔ nɛ je ɔ susu kaa kuasia sane ɔ ye ɔ yi wami. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />E ji kuasia sane kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ, ejakaa a ngɛ hlae nɛ a na hiɔwe okadi ko lolo nɛ tsɔɔ kaa anɔkuale fiɛmi i; nɛ e ji kuasia fiɛmi kɛ ha Hela bi ɔmɛ hu, ejakaa a dii ni lemi se, nɛ ja a he je ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ kɛ a ni lemi ɔ sɔ nɛ a heɔ yeɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ naa wa he abofu kaa wa fiɛ ke Kristo gbo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e he a yi wami ɔ, wɔ jali ɔmɛ lɛɛ e ji kuasia sane ngɛ a tue mi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Se Mawu bli nihi nɛ e tsɛ kɛ ba yi wami hemi mi ɔ a hɛ ngmɛ konɛ a na kaa Kristo ji Mawu he wami agbo nɛ ma he a yi wami. Nɛ Kristo ɔ nitsɛ ji Mawu blɔ nya tomi nɛ e ma kɛ kpɔ mɛ ɔ e nyatsɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Mawu blɔ nya tomi nɛ a susu kaa e ji kuasia blɔ nya tomi ɔ, nile ngɛ mi hluu pe nimli a nile, nɛ Mawu gbɔjɔmi he wa hluu pe nɔmlɔ adesa he wami.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛ kai bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ loko Kristo tsɛ nyɛ ɔ, kaa nyɛ ti nihi bɔɔ pɛ nɛ ngɛ biɛ agbohi kɛ he wami kɛ sika. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Se mohu Mawu ngɔ juɛmi nɛ je ɔ susu kaa nile be mi ɔ ke tsu ni konɛ e kɛ gbe nihi nɛ je ɔ le kaa ni leli ɔ zo. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />E gu blɔ nya tomihi nɛ je ɔ bui nɛ a gbe he guɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e kɛ ba nihi nɛ je ɔ susu kaa a ji nimli nguahi ɔ si, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />konɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko fia ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi.<verse eid="1CO 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ejakaa Mawu kɛkɛ mi nɛ nyɛ na wami ngɛ kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ. E tsɔɔ wɔ Mawu yi wami hemi he blɔ nya tomi ɔ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ha nɛ wa sa Mawu hɛ mi. E tsu wa he nɛ e pee wɔ klɔuklɔu; nɛ e ngɔ e he kɛ ha kɛ wo wa yi wami hemi he hiɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ deɔ ɔ, “Ke nɔ ko maa fia a, e fia ngɔ fɔ nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ pee ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu kuasia blɔ nya tomi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, benɛ i ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, tsa pi nya mi tsɔmi fitsofitso loo juɛmi ni lemi nya nɛ i kɛ ba fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Ejakaa ye yi mi tomi kɛkɛ ji kaa ma jaje Yesu Kristo kɛ e sɛumi tso nɔ gbenɔ ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Nɛ i ba nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ gbɔjɔmi kɛ gbeye yemi kɛ he kpokpomi mi. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Nɛ ye fiɛmi ɔ mi tsɔ paa, tsa pi ngɛ nya mi tsɔmi fitsofitso kɛ nɔmlɔ adesa ni lemi munyu tumi mi, se mohu Mumi Klɔuklɔu he wami ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ ye munyu ɔmɛ a mi, konɛ nihi nɛ nu ɔ, a yo kaa Mawu ngɔ nɛ e je. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />I pee enɛ ɔ, ejakaa i ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ pi si ngɛ Mawu mi, se pi nɔmlɔ adesa ni lemi nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Se kɛ ɔ, i tuɔ ni lemi munyuhi ngɛ nihi nɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ pi si ngɛ Kristo mi momo ɔmɛ a kpɛti, se pi je nɛ ɔ mi ni lemi aloo je ɔ mi nimli nguahi nɛ be yi wami nami ɔ a munyu ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Nyasa ngɛ wa munyu ɔmɛ ami, ejakaa a je Mawu ngɔ, nɛ a tsɔɔ wɔ Mawu blɔ nya tomi nɛ e kɛ wɔ maa ya anunyami mi ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ. A to blɔ nya nɛ ɔ loko a bɔ je ɔ mohu, se a ngɔ kɛ laa wɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Se je nɛ ɔ mi nimli ngua amɛ nui sisi, ejakaa e ji a nu sisi jinɛ a be Anunyami Nutsɔ ɔ sɛue.<verse eid="1CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ja a ji bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa nɔmlɔ adesa ko hɛ ngmɛ nɛ, nɛ tue ko hu nui, nɛ nɔ́ ko hu be nyɛe maa kale nyakpɛ níhi nɛ Mawu dla kɛ to nihi nɛ suɔ Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa le ni nɛ ɔmɛ, ejakaa Mawu je mɛ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ kɛ gu e Mumi ɔ nɔ; nɛ e Mumi ɔ hlaa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi, nɛ e tsɔɔ wɔ Mawu laami nihi kulaa nɛ mi kuɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nɔ ko li nɔ́ nɛ e nyɛmi susuu aloo bɔ nɛ e nyɛmi ngɛ ha pɔtɛɛ, kaa ja jamɛ a nɔ ɔ nitsɛ kɛkɛ. Ja a nɔuu kɛ nɔ ko li Mawu susumi ɔmɛ kaa ja Mawu nitsɛ e Mumi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Mawu ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Mumi ha wɔ. Tsa pi je nɛ ɔ mi mumi ɔ, konɛ e tsɔɔ wɔ nyakpɛ dloomi nike nihi kɛ jɔɔmi nɛ Mawu kɛ ke wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Mumi ɔ nitsɛ munyuhi nɛ e tu wɔ ngɛ nike ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɔuu wa ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ nɛ, se pi munyuhi nɛ wɔ kaa nimli adesahi wa susu. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, waa kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ munyuhi tsɔɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu anɔkuale munyuhi a mi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Se nɔ ko nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ, e be nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi nue, nɛ e be Mawu susumi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Mumi ɔ je kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ wɔ ɔ ngɔe. Ejakaa a ji kuasia níhi ngɛ e tue mi; se ni nɛmɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ a mi ji nihi nɛ naa nɔ́ nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ nya. Nɛ ni komɛ hu pe a be nyɛe maa ngɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Se nɔ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ e mi ɔ naa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ; nɛ je mi no ɔ nya kpɛɔ e he nɛ e haoɔ, ejakaa e nui lɛ sisi. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Se Niinɛ, kɛ e maa pee kɛ nu sisi kɛɛ? Ejakaa e pi nɔ ko nɛ maa le Nutsɔ ɔ juɛmi, aloo e kɛ lɛ ma susu nɔ́ he, aloo nɔ ko nɛ maa gu sɔlemi nɔ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ maa pee nɔ́ ko. Se e ji nyakpɛ nɔ́ ko kaa wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli lɛɛ wa hɛɛ Kristo juɛmi kɛ e nile ɔ e mi eko.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nihi nɛ a juɛmi se ti we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ munyu tue kaa bimwɔwi ngɛ Mawu jami mi, nihi nɛ a be Nutsɔ ɔ mi, se mohu a ngɛ he lo se die. I be nyɛe nɛ i kɛ nyɛ maa tu munyu kaa Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ a hyi tɔ kɛ Mumi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />I ha nyɛ nyɔ, pi niye ni nɛ he wa, ejakaa nyɛ nyɛ we nɛ nyɛɛ ta niye ni nɛ he wa. Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ tete po nyɔ ɔ nɔuu a ma kɛ lɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ejakaa bimwɔwi ji nyɛ ngɛ Mawu jami mi, nɛ kɛ ba su amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ nyɛɛ we ngɛ Mawu blɔ tsɔɔmi nya se mohu ngɛ he lo nya. Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he hunga jee. Nɛ pɛ tsɔwi gba nyɛ mi ɔ nɛɛ, anɛ enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa bimwɔwi ji nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ suɔ pee kɛ sa lo? Niinɛ, nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ je mi bae kaa nihi nɛ a pi Nutsɔ ɔ bimɛ kulaa. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pɛe ngɛ i kɛ Apolo wa ti nɔ nɛ pa e nyɛmi he. Nɛ nyɛ ha asafo ɔ mi gba a, anɛ e tsɔɔ we kaa nyɛ wɛ kulaa ngɛ Mawu jami mi lo?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Mɛnɔ kulaa ji mi, nɛ mɛnɔ kulaa ji Apolo nɛ a pɛɛ ngɛ e he? Mawu sɔmɔli kɛkɛ ji wɔ, nɛ wa hɛɛ nike ni titli komɛ, nɛ kɛ gu wa nɔ ɔ, nyɛ he ye. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Ami lɛɛ i du wu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi, nɛ Apolo pue nɔ nyu. Nɛ tsa pi wɔ, se Mawu nɛ ha e wa. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Se tsa pi nɔ nɛ du wu ɔ aloo nɔ nɛ pue nɔ nyu ɔ nɛ he hia, se mohu Mawu nɔ nɛ ha nɛ e wa a ji nɔ nɛ he hia. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />I kɛ Apolo ngɛ kuu kake mi kɛ ngɛ ni tsue. Wa hɛɛ oti kake se a maa wo wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔ he. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Wɔɔ lɛɛ Mawu he piɛli kɛkɛ ji wɔ ngɛ ni tsumi mi. Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ Mawu abɔɔ kɛ e tsu ji nyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ngɛ Mawu dloomi nya a, e pee mi tsu mami he galɔ. I tsua si voo nɛ i to tsu ɔ sisi, nɛ Apolo fia nɔ. Se nɔ nɛ fiaa tsu nɛ a to sisi nɔ ɔ, e sa nɛ e hyɛ nɛ e fia lɛ nɛ hi. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Nɛ sisi kpa ko be nɛ nɔ ko maa to nɛ maa hi pe nɔ́ nɛ a to momo nɛ ji Kristo ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Se tsu mami nihi slɔɔtoslɔɔtohi ngɛ nɛ a ma kɛ fia jamɛ a tsu nɛ a to sisi ɔ nɔ. Ni komɛ kɛ sika tsu fiaa, nɛ ni komɛ hu kɛ sika hiɔ loo tɛ nɛ he jua wa loo tso loo nga maa tsu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Se be ma nɛ a maa ka maa hyɛ nɔ́ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ ma e tsu ɔ ha ngɛ Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ. Ejakaa a maa ka nɔ tsuaa nɔ ni tsumi kɛ gu la mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na e ni tsumi ɔ paa kaa e gbe nya nɛ e hi kɛ pi si lo. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Nɛ ni tsulɔ tsuaa ni tsulɔ nɛ fia e tsu ɔ ngɛ sisi nɛ a to nɔ kɛ tsu mami ni kpakpahi nɛ tsu ɔ nyɛ da si ɔ, e nine maa su e hiɔwo nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Se ke e tsu ɔ sa a, lɛɛ e maa je mi dɛ gu. A ma he lɛ nitsɛ e yi wami mohu, se e maa pee kaa nɔ ko nɛ tu fo kɛ gu la glegleegle mi.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa nyɛ tsuo Mawu Sɔlemi We ji nyɛ, nɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ hii nyɛ mi lo? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ke nɔ ko wo Mawu Sɔlemi We ɔ he mu nɛ e puɛ lɛ ɔ, Mawu ma kpata e hɛ mi. Ejakaa Mawu Sɔlemi We ɔ he tsɔ nɛ e ngɛ klɔuklɔu, nɛ nyɛ ji jamɛ a we ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Nyɛ kpa nyɛ he mlɔɔmi. Ke nyɛ ti nɔ ko wo e he kɛ to je nɛ ɔ mi nihi a he nɛ e susu kaa ni lelɔ ji lɛ ɔ, e maa hi ha lɛ kaa e ngmɛɛ jamɛ a juɛmi ɔ he nɛ e pee e he kuasia bɔ nɛ pee nɛ lɔ ɔ nɛ ko tsi lɛ hiɔwe nile nami he blɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ejakaa je nɛ ɔ mi ni lemi ɔ ji kuasia nɔ́ ko ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi; kaa bɔ nɛ a de ngɛ Hiob Womi ɔ mi ke, Mawu guu ni lelɔ nitsɛ e hɛ mi tɛmi ɔ nɔ kɛ nuɔ lɛ; lɛ nitsɛ e ni lemi ɔ haa e hɛ mi kpataa. <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu a de wɔ ngɛ David La Womi ɔ mi ke, Nutsɔ ɔ le bɔ nɛ nɔmlɔ adesa juɛmi tsuɔ ni ha, kaa kuasia kɛ yaka nihi e tsuɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko fia ngɔ fɔ je nɛ ɔ mi ni leli a nɔ. Ejakaa Mawu ha nyɛ nyɛ hiami níhi kulaa momo. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />E ha nyɛ Paulo kɛ Apolo kɛ Petro kaa nyɛ he piɛli; nɛ e ha nyɛ je nɛ ɔ tsuo nɛ nyɛ tsu he ni. Nɛ wami kɛ gbenɔ tete ɔ, nyɛ sɔmɔli ji mɛ, Nihi tsuo nɛ ngɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ kɛ nihi nɛ maa ba amɛ kulaa nyɛ nihi ji mɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ Kristo nihi ji nyɛ, nɛ Kristo ɔ, Mawu nɔ́ i.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ a bu Apolo kɛ ami kaa Kristo sɔmɔli kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛli kɛ e laami sane ɔmɛ a mi tsɔɔli. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Nɔ́ nɛ a hlaa ngɛ sɔmɔlɔ tsuaa sɔmɔlɔ dɛ ji kaa e ye e nutsɔ gbi nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nɛ ami nɛɛ, anɛ i hine sɔmɔlɔ kpakpa lo? I hɛwi ye he ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ma de ngɛ enɛ ɔ he, aloo nɔ́ nɛ nɔ ko ma susu. Nɛ ami nitsɛ po i be ye he nyɛe ma kojo ngɛ enɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />I nɛ yayami ko ngɛ ye he mohu, se lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa a bu mi bemi, ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ ji nɔ nɛ maa kojo mi.<verse eid="1CO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ja a he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi nɛ nyɛ ko kojo nɔ ko kɛ sɛ hlami loko Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ ba nɛ e ba na kaa nɔ́ ko hine sɔmɔlɔ kpakpa loo sɔmɔlɔ tue gbolɔ. Ejakaa ke Nutsɔ ɔ ba a, e kɛ la ma je wa tsuihi a mi ni ɔmɛ kpo nɛ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa na bɔ nɛ e nyɛmi ngɛ ha tutuutu. Enɛ ɔ mi nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa na nɔ́ he je nɛ wa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsue ngɛ. Nɛ jamɛ a ngmlɛfia a nɔ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ma na e yi jemi nɛ sa lɛ ɔ kɛ je Mawu dɛ mi.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ ko hyɛ nɔ ko hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Nyɛ he je nɛ i ngɔ Apolo kɛ ami nitsɛ ye he kɛ ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he toe ngɛ konɛ ma kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ i pɔɔ demi ɔ nya ke, nyɛ ko bu nɔ ko he akɔtaa pe nɔ ko. Nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko nɛ ko fia kɛ fɔ Mawu tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko nɔ pe nɔ ko. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Mɛni ha e slo mo ngɛ nɔ ko he? Nɛ mɛni o ngɛ nɛ pi Mawu nɛ ha mo? Nɛ ke Mawu ji nɔ nɛ ha mo nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, mɛni he je mɔ nɛ o ngɛ o he pee agbo kaa nɔ́ nɛ mo nitsɛ o he wami nya nɛ o na nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ ɔ?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />E peeɔ nyɛ kaa nyɛ nine su Mumi mi niye ni nɛ he hia nyɛ ɔ tsuo nɔ́ momo. Nyɛ hyi kɛ Mumi ɔ mo; nyɛ plɛ matsɛmɛ ni nali, nɛ nyɛ je wa he ngɛ se lokoo ngɛ matsɛ yee. I na nɛ nyɛ ngɛ matsɛ yee niinɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke jamɛ a be ɔ su ɔ, waa kɛ nyɛ nɛ ye matsɛ ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />I susuu be komɛ kaa Mawu ngɔ wɔ bɔfo ɔmɛ ngɔ pee se kpɛli, kaa nihi nɛ a bu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ nɛ a maa gbe mɛ, nɛ a to wɔ kɛ ha nimli kɛ hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ a hyɛ wɔ.<verse eid="1CO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Wɔɔ lɛɛ nyɛ deɔ ke Mawu jami ha wa pee kuasiahi, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ni leli kɛ juɛmitsɛmɛ ji nyɛ. Wɔɔ wa gbɔjɔ, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ ngɛ he wami. A buu nyɛ, se wɔɔ lɛɛ a yeɔ wa he fɛu. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Kɛ ba si ngmlɛfia nɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, hwɔ kɛ kuma ngɛ wɔ yee, nɛ he hami nihi tete po wa be bɔ nɛ sa nɛ wa ma kɛ tsi fiɛ. A peeɔ wɔ nihi nɛ sɛ, nɛ wa be wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa sihi he ko. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Wa gboɔ dengme nɛ wa tsuɔ ni kɛ wa nine konɛ wa na wa nya ngma. Wa jɔɔ nihi nɛ gbiɛɛ wɔ ɔ, nɛ wa toɔ tsui si haa nihi nɛ wa wɔ yi mi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Benɛ a ngɛ wa he munyu yayahi tue ɔ, wa haa heto kɛ he si bami. Nɛ kɛ ba si piɔ ɔ, wa ngɛ kaa nane si bunyuku kɛ kuku nɔ dwɔmi.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />I ngmɛ nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ ma kɛ gbe nyɛ zo, se mohu i ngɛ nyɛ tue nɔ woe kɛ slɔmi kaa bimɛ nɛ a suɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ejakaa ke nyɛ ngɛ ni tsɔɔli akpe nyɔngma nɛ maa tsɔɔ nyɛ Kristo he ni tete po ɔ, nyɛ kai kaa ami nɔ kake too ji nyɛ tsɛ. Ejakaa ami ji nɔ nɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ Kristo benɛ i fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae nɛ nyɛɛ kase mi.<verse eid="1CO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɛ Timoteo nyɛ ngɔ tsɔe ɔ nɛ konɛ e ba ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ pee enɛ ɔ. Lɛ ji nihi nɛ i na kɛ ha Kristo ɔ a ti nɔ kake. E ji ye suɔmi bi anɔkualetsɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. E ma kai nyɛ nihi nɛ i tsɔɔ ngɛ asafo tsuaa asafo mi he fɛɛ he nɛ i ya a.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />I le kaa nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɛ a he nɔ woe, ejakaa a ngɛ susue kaa i be nyɛ ngɔ bae. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Se ke Nutsɔ ɔ suɔ ɔ, i be kɛe nɛ i ma ba nyɛ ngɔ. I ma ba na ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ a he nɔ woe ɔ konɛ ma hyɛ mɛ ha kaa a ngɛ Mawu he wami ɔ niinɛ aloo munyu gu tuli kɛkɛ ji mɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ejakaa tsa pi munyu gu tumi mi nɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ ngɛ, se mohu he wami mi. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Kɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae kɛɛ? Ma ba nyɛ ngɔ kɛ tue gblami aloo ma ba kɛ suɔmi kɛ he jɔmi?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo fa nɔ fiemi ngɛ sɔlemi ɔ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ajuama bɔmi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ he munyu tue. Enɛ ɔ ji yayami nɛ a nɛ ngɛ wɔ jali ɔmɛ tete a kpɛti. Nyɛ ti nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ asafo ɔ mi ngɛ e tsɛ yo ngɔe. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he nɔ woe ke nimli klɔuklɔu ji nyɛ mɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ yi kɔmɔ konɛ a je nɔ nɛ tsu kikɛmɛ a zo ni nɛ ɔ kɛ je asafo ɔ mi?<verse eid="1CO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />I be nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso mi mohu, se i susuu kikɛmɛ a zo ni nɛ ɔ he, nɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi ɔ, i susu nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa a pee ajuama bɔlɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Lɔ ɔ ji kaa nyɛ tsɛ asafo ɔ kpe ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi, nɛ ma piɛ nyɛ he ngɛ mumi mi; <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />nɛ nyɛɛ fie zotsɛ ɔ kɛ je asafo ɔ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ lɛ ngɔ wo Abosiami dɛ nɛ e kpata e he lo ɔ hɛ mi konɛ a he e klaa yi wami ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu bami ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />E ji gbeye sane kaa nyɛ ngɛ fiae kaa nyɛ he tsɔ be mi nɛ kikɛmɛ a yayami nɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti. Anɛ nyɛ li kaa ke nyɛ ti nɔ kake ngɛ yayami pee ɔ, e yayami ɔ ma sa nyɛ tsuo kulaa lo? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ je yayami peelɔ ɔ we konɛ nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ he tsɔmi mi, ejakaa a gbe Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Tobi ɔ ngɛ wa he. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha waa ye lɛ nɛ waa wa ngɛ Kristo jami mi, nɛ wa kpa yayami peemi. Nyɛ ha nɛ waa ye anunyami kɛ anɔkuale abolo nɛ he tsɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />I de nyɛ ngɛ womi nɛ i ngma nyɛ kekle ɔ mi ɔ ke nyɛɛ kɛ yayami peeli nɛ ko bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Se tsa pi ajuama bɔli nɛ he we wa Manye Munyu ɔ yi loo hɛ tsuli kɛ juli kɛ wɔ jali a he munyu nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tue, ejakaa ja nyɛ si je ɔ mi loko ji nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ be bɔe. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe ji kaa nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ ko nɛ ji nyɛmi ngɛ Kristo mi se e pee e he ajuama bɔlɔ loo hɛ tsulɔ loo ojo fialɔ loo amimi yelɔ loo wɔ jalɔ loo da delɔ loo nɔ jelɔ nɛ ko bɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ jamɛatsɛ ɔ nɛ ko ye ni tete po.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa he kojomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Wa be he blɔ nɛ wa kojoɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ be wa kpɛti ɔ. Se wa ngɛ he blɔ nɛ wa kojoɔ asafo ɔ mi bimɛ nɛ ngɛ yayami pee ɔ nɛ waa kɛ mɛ yeɔ saminya. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Mawu pɛ ji nɔ́ nɛ kojoɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ be wa kpɛti ɔ. Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛɛ kojo nyumu ɔ nɛ nyɛ je lɛ kɛ je asafo ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Mɛni he je nɛ ke nyɛ ti nɔ ko kɛ e nyɛmi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ na sane ɔ, e ke lɛ yɛ e nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli a ngɔ nɛ a ye sane ɔ ha lɛ, se e ya woɔ e he munyu ngɛ nihi nɛ pi Mawu jali a ngɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli ji ni nɛmɛ nɛ maa ye je ɔ nɔ, nɛ wa maa kojo hwɔɔ se ko lo? Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ nyɛ we munyu tsɔwitsɔwi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ kojo ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti mɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Anɛ nyɛ li hu kaa wɔ ji ni nɛmɛ nɛ maa kojo hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ po lo? Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa kaa nyɛ nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ye nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ sanehi ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e ko wa ha nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Mɛni he je mɔ nɛ nyɛ woɔ nyɛ sanehi kɛ ya haa nihi nɛ be nyɛ kpɛti nɛ a pi Kristo se nyɛɛli tete? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Anɛ zo gbi nyɛ lo? Anɛ ni lelɔ ko kulaa be asafo ɔ mi nɛ ma nyɛ sane nɛ ɔmɛ maa ye lo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Asafo ɔ mi no ya woɔ e nyɛmi asafo mi no he munyu nɛ e kɛ lɛ yeɔ sane ngɛ nihi nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛli a hɛ mi.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Nɛ kaa nyɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ he maa hi munyu yee ɔ, e ji si gbeemi. Mɛni he je nyɛ sume nɛ ke a pee nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ dɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ he kɛkɛ? E ji hɛ mi nyami womi kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ, ke nyɛ ha nɛ a sisi nyɛ gu. <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Se nyɛ nitsɛmɛ mohu ji yayami peeli ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛ sisiɔ nihi kɛ nyɛ nyɛmimɛ tete po.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi pi nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ya he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa nihi nɛ peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a nine be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ nɔ sue lo? Nyɛ ko sisi nyɛ he! Yakayaka ni peeli nɛ ji wɔ jali kɛ ajuama bɔli loo nyumuhi nɛ kɛ a nyɛmi nyumuhi peeɔ yakayaka ni; <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />kɛ juli kɛ hɛ tsuli kɛ da deli kɛ nɔ he guɛ gbeli a nine be Hiɔwe Matsɛyemi ɔ nɔ sue. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Nyɛ ti ni komɛ pee kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ hyɛ, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a fɔ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ ngɛ nyɛ he, nɛ a ngɔ nyɛ kɛ to ha Mawu, nɛ e ngɔ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo kɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ tsu kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ he je. <verse eid="1CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />I ngɛ he blɔ nɛ i peeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mohu, se tsa pi ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa eko nɛ hi kɛ ha mi. Nɛ ke a ha mi he blɔ kaa ma pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i suɔ tete ɔ, ke jamɛ a nɔ́ ɔ maa ye ye nɔ nɛ i be nyɛe kpami ɔ, i be pee. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ke waa kɛ niye ni to enɛ ɔ he ɔ, Mawu ha wɔ niye ni ke waa ye kɛ muklii nɛ e wɛɛ niye ni ɔ. Se enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa waa ye niye ni ɔ nɛ waa tɔ tsɔ. Nyɛ ko susu niye ni he kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ he hia tsɔ, ejakaa Mawu ma ha nɛ muklii kɛ niye ni tsuo se maa po ligbi ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 6:13">Ajuama bɔmi hi, ejakaa a bɔɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ kɛ ha ajuama bɔmi. Se mohu a bɔ mɛ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ, nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ suɔ nɛ e hi wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu tle Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, ja a nɔuu e ma tle wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ si kɛ je gbeje ngɛ e he wami nya. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Anɛ nyɛ li kaa nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ ɔ Kristo nitsɛ he nihi ji mɛ lo? Ma nyɛ ma ngɔ Kristo he fa ko kɛ to ajuama bɔlɔ he lo? Dabi! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Aloo nyɛ li kaa ke nɔ ko kɛ e he bɔ ajuama bɔlɔ he ɔ, e kɛ lɛ peeɔ nɔmlɔ tso kake lo? Ejakaa Mawu de wɔ ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi kaa mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ kulaa a plɛ he lo kake ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Se nɔ nɛ kɛ e he ha Nutsɔ ɔ, e kɛ Kristo peeɔ nɔmlɔ kake.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i deɔ ke nyɛɛ tu ajuama bɔmi nya fo ɔ nɛ. Yayami ko be nɛ puɛɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ kaa ajuama bɔmi; nɛ nɔ nɛ bɔɔ ajuama a, e ji yayami nɛ e peeɔ kɛ siɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Anɛ nyɛ li kɛ sa kaa nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ ɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ Mawu kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ e sihi he i lo? Tsa pi nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ nihi ji nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Ejakaa Mawu he nyɛ kɛ jua nɛ wa. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami, ejakaa e nihi ji nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gbami he sane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ ngma kɛ mane mi ɔmɛ a he ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, ke nɔ ko ngɔɛ yo ɔ, e hi. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Se ngɛ ajuama bɔmi he ɔ, e sa kaa nyumu tsuaa nyumu nɛ e hi lɛ nitsɛ e yo, nɛ yo tsuaa yo nɛ e hi lɛ nitsɛ e huno.<verse eid="1CO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Yotsɛ nɛ pee e yo ɔ blɔ nya níhi tsuo ngɔ ha lɛ, nɛ hunotsɛ ɔ hu e pee e huno ɔ blɔ nya nihi tsuo ngɔ ha lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ejakaa ke yo gba a, e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɔ he wami ɔ kulaa pi e nɔ́ hu, ejakaa e huno ɔ hu ngɛ e nɔ́ he wami. Ja a nɔuu kɛ huno ɔ hu e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɔ he wami ɔ kulaa pi e nɔ, ejakaa e yo ɔ hu nɔ́ i. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko nyɛ nyɛ bi he blɔ nɛ ɔmɛ a he. Ja nyumu kɛ e yo ɔ tsuo a to kaa a ma kua a bi gba si himi he blɔ nya amɛ hami kɛ ya si be ko, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na deka kɛ sɔle. Se enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a pee kake ekohu kaa bɔ nɛ a ngɛ kekle ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Abosiami nɛ ko na he blɔ nɛ e ka mɛ ngɛ a he nɔ nɛ a nyɛ we nɛ a ye ɔ he.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />I be nyɛ nɔ nyɛe ke nyɛɛ ngɔ yo, se e sa kaa nyɛɛ ngɔ yo ke nyɛ suɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Se e je ye he ɔ, jinɛ ma suɔ kaa nyɛ ko ngɔ yo nɛ nyɛɛ hi si kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɛ ɔ. Se wɔ tsuo wa sɔɛ. Mawu ha ni komɛ huno loo yo kɛ si himi kaa a dloomi nike ni, nɛ e dloo ni komɛ hu kaa a hi si gu nɛ a na bua jɔmi. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nihi nɛ ngɔɛ yo kɛ ahoyihi dee ke a hi si kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ ɔ, a ko ngɔ yo nɛ a ko gba ke ji a ma nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Se ke a be a he nɔ nyɛe maa ye ɔ, lɛɛ a sɛ gba si himi mi. Ejakaa gba si himi hi pe akɔnɔ se dimi.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ sɛ gba si himi mi ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ kita nɛ je Mawu ngɔ woe kaa, yo nɛ ko si e huno. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Se ke yo kua gba a, e hi si nɛ e ko gba hu, aloo e kpale kɛ ho nɛ e kɛ e huno ɔ nɛ a ya dla. Nɛ huno hu nɛ e ko ngmɛɛ e yo he.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Ma suɔ nɛ ma wo nyɛ ga kɛ piɛ Mawu kita amɛ a he kaa, ke nyɛmi ko ngɛ asafo ɔ mi nɛ e ngɛ yo nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ, se yo ɔ suɔ kaa e kɛ lɛ maa hi si ɔ, e ko ngmɛɛ e he. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ ke yo ko hu ngɛ asafo ɔ mi nɛ e ngɛ huno nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ, se nyumu ɔ suɔ kaa e kɛ lɛ maa hi si ɔ, e ko kua lɛ gbami. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ejakaa, eko ɔ, nyumu nɛ he we yi nɛ ɔ maa gu yo nɛ he ye ɔ nɔ kɛ plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ. Nɛ yo nɛ he we yi ɔ hu maa gu e huno nɛ ji Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ sɛ asafo ɔ mi. Ke pi ja a, ke gba a puɛ ɔ, bi ɔmɛ be Nutsɔ ɔ lee. Se jinɛ ngɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi nya a, a maa gu yo kɛ e huno a kake peemi kɛ si himi ɔ nɔ kɛ he bi ɔmɛ a yi wami.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Se ke huno loo yo nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ suɔ kaa e ma kua gba a, e ya. Ngɛ enɛ ɔ mi ɔ, huno loo yo nɔ nɛ ji Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ, e ko tsi e nya, ejakaa Mawu suɔ nɛ e bi ɔmɛ a hi si ngɛ he jɔmi kɛ kake peemi mi. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Ejakaa a be nɔ mi mami kɛ ha nyɛ yi ɔmɛ kaa nyɛ huno ɔmɛ ma tsake, ke a kɛ nyɛ ma tsa nɔ kɛ hi si; nɛ ja a nɔuu a ngɛ nyumu ɔmɛ hu dee ngɛ a yi ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nɛ loko ji nɔ ko maa ma e juɛmi nya si ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔmɛ eko mi ɔ, e hyɛ ha kaa e si himi ɔ ngɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae ɔ lo, kaa o ngɔ yo aloo o ko ngɔ yo ngɛ e blɔ tsɔɔmi kɛ e yemi kɛ buami nya a. Nɛ si himi tsuaa si himi nɛ e ma ha mo ɔ, o ngɔ nɔ. Enɛ ɔ ji mlaa nɛ i wo ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ kulaa a mi.<verse eid="1CO 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ke a wo nɔ ko nyumu mi loko ji e plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ, e ko hao lɛ; nɛ nɔ nɛ a wui lɛ nyumu mi loko ji e plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ, e ko ha nɛ a wo lɛ nyumu mi hu. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ejakaa slɔɔto ko be nyɛmi nɛ a wo lɛ nyumu mi kɛ nɔ nɛ a wui lɛ nyumu mi ɔ a kpɛti. Se mohu, nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji Mawu kita amɛ a nɔ yemi.<verse eid="1CO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tsa ni tsumi nɛ e ngɛ tsue loko ji Mawu tsɛ lɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ke nyɔguɛ ji mo ɔ, e ko hao mo, se ke o ma nyɛ o he ma je kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ sisi ɔ, moo pee ja. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ke Nutsɔ ɔ tsɛ mo nɛ o ji nyɔguɛ ɔ, mo na nɛ o le kaa Kristo kpɔ mo kɛ je yayami he wami ɔ mi; nɛ ke Mawu tsɛ mo nɛ odehe ji mo ɔ, o peeɔ Kristo nyɔguɛ jehanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Kristo he nyɛ kɛ jua nɛ wa nɛ e wo nyɛ yi hiɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ pee e nihi. Nyɛ ko pee nyɛ he nimli a nyɔguɛhi hu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ja a he je ɔ, mamimɛ suɔli, si himi mi nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ loko ji a tsɛ lɛ ɔ, e hi jamɛ a si himi ɔ nɔuu mi, ejakaa jehanɛ ɔ Nutsɔ ɔ maa ye kɛ bua lɛ ngɛ jamɛ a si himi ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ yiwi nɛ gbɛ lolo a he ɔ, i be kita womi pɔtɛɛ ko kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ dɛ kɛ ha mɛ kaa a gba aloo a ko gba. Se ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ e mi mi jɔmi he je ɔ, e dloo mi nile nɛ ma nyɛ ma da nɔ, nɛ ma de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ i susu.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli wa ngɛ he hiami be mi, nɛ ja a he je ɔ, e peeɔ mi kaa ngɛ kikɛmɛ a be nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, e maa hi ha nɔ ko kaa e ko gba aloo e ko ngɔ yo. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Se nɔ nɛ ngɔ yo momo ɔ, e ko puɛ gba ngɛ enɛ ɔ he. Se ke nɔ ko be yo ɔ, e ko ngɔ eko ngɛ be nɛ ɔ mi. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nɛ ke nyɛ nyumu ɔmɛ nyɛ pee nyɛ juɛmi kaa nyɛ maa ngɔ yo hu ɔ, nyɛɛ ya nyɛ hɛ mi. Nɛ ke yiheyo hu ke e maa gba ngɛ be nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, e pee we yayami. Se mohu gba si himi kɛ haomi maa ba, nɛ i be suɔe nɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ ba nyɛ nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Nɔ́ kake nɛ sa nɛ nyɛɛ le ji kaa be nɛ piɛ ha wɔ ɔ pi, nɛ e ji be nɛ sa kaa wa kɛ tsu wa Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ. Ja a he je ɔ, yitsɛmɛ tete a pee a he kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ be eko nɛ a hi si kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Nyami loo kɔmɔ yemi loo ni nami nɛ ko tsi nɔ ko blɔ ngɛ Mawu ni tsumi mi. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsuɔ je nɛ ɔ mi he ni ɔ, a ya nɔ nɛ a ye e mi ngɔɔmi níhi nɛ a na he blɔ ɔ, ejakaa e be kɛe nɛ je ɔ maa be kɛ ho.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nɛ i ngɛ dee ke, nyɛ ko hao ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsue mi. Nɔ nɛ ngɔɛ yo ɔ, e ngɔ e be ɔ kɛ tsu Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ, nɛ e susu bɔ nɛ e maa pee kɛ sa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Se yo ngɔlɔ be enɛ ɔ nyɛe peemi bɔ nɛ sa, ejakaa e susuu e blɔ nya ni tsumihi ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi kɛ bɔ nɛ e ma ha e yo bua jɔmi he. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Ja a he je ɔ, e juɛmi peeɔ enyɔ. Kikɛ ɔ nɔuu yoyo nɛ gba a hu e baami haa lɛ. E naa kikɛmɛ a nyagba nɛ ɔ nɔuu. Se zangmayo lɛɛ e kɛ e he tsuo haa Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ ni tsumi tsuaa ni tsumi mi konɛ e wo e hɛ mi nyami.Yogbayo haoɔ e he ngɛ ni kpahi a he, kaa we mi ni tsumihi kɛ bɔ nɛ e maa pee kɛ jɔɔ e huno bua.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Tsa pi yo ngɔmi nya nɛ i ngɛ tsie ha nyɛ, se mohu ga i ngɛ nyɛ woe bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ sɔmɔ Nutsɔ ɔ bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ ní komɛ nɛ ko tsi nyɛ blɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Se ke nɔ ko susu kaa e sa nɛ e ngɔ yo, ejakaa e be e he nɔ nyɛe maa ye ɔ, e pi yayami ke e ngɔ yo. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Se ke nɔ ko ma nyɛ ye e he nɔ aloo e nu e he lo sisi kaa e sɛ nɛ e ngɔ yo ɔ, lɛɛ e ji juɛmi kpakpa. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ ngɔ yo ɔ, e pee saminya. Se nɔ nɛ ngɔɛ yo ɔ, e pee saminya pe yo ngɔlɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Yo ɔ, be abɔ nɛ e huno ɔ ngɛ je mi ɔ, mlaa fi lɛ ngɔ pɛtɛ e huno ɔ he. Ke e huno ɔ gbo ɔ lɛɛ e ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e gbaa nɔ nɛ e suɔ ekohu, se ja e gba ngɛ Kristo mi. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Se ngɛ ye juɛmi nya a, e ma na bua jɔmi babauu ke e gbɛ hu; nɛ e peeɔ mi kaa i ngɛ nyɛ slɔe ngɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ blɔ tsɔɔmi nya.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Wɔhi a niye ni hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ kɔɔ wɔ nya niye ni yemi he, kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ de ɔ, “Wɔ kulaa wa le ni.” Wa le ni mohu, se ni lemi haa nɔ woɔ e he nɔ. Nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji suɔmi nɛ wa ma kɛ ha nɛ asafo ɔ nɛ pi si. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ke nɔ́ ko susu kaa e le nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, e ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa e li nɔ́ ko nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Se nɔ nɛ suɔ Mawu kɛ e tsui mi kulaa ji nɔ nɛ Mawu he nile ngɛ e mi.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ke ja a, lɛɛ kɛ ji lɛ kɛɛ? Anɛ e sa kaa waa ye wɔhi a nya niye ni lo? Wɔ tsuo wa le klɛdɛɛ kaa wɔ ko wɔ ko be je nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu Mawu kake too nɛ ngɛ, nɛ mawu kpa ko be hu. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ni komɛ deɔ ke mawuhi fuu ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa le kaa Mawu kake too nɛ ngɛ, nɛ lɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ nɛ bɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́, nɛ e pee wɔ lɛ nitsɛ e nihi; kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo kake, nɔ nɛ lɛɛ e nɔ a gu kɛ bɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́, nɛ lɛ e haa wɔ wami ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Se anyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli komɛ ngɛ nɛ a li anɔkuale sane nɛ ɔ. Nɛ kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ, a susu kaa wɔhi ngɛ wami; lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a kɛ hemi kɛ yemi yeɔ wɔhi a nya bɔ sami niye ni ɔ, se a he nile haoɔ mɛ nɛ e kojoɔ mɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nyɛ kai kaa niye ni gba we waa kɛ Mawu wa kpɛti. Ke wa ye ɔ, e be hae nɛ waa hi pe bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ ɔ. Nɛ ke wa yi hu, wa laa we nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi nɛ nyɛ ko da he blɔ nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye, nɛ lɔ ɔ nɛ ba tɔtɔ nyɛmimɛ nɛ a hemi kɛ yemi mi wɛ kaa nyɛ nɔ ɔ nane.<verse eid="1CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ, bɔ nɛ e maa ba ha ji, nɔ nɛ susuu kaa e ji yayami ke e ye niye ni nɛ ɔ, ke e na mo ni lelɔ nɛ o hii si ngɛ wɔ piɛ mi ngɛ yee ɔ, e maa wo lɛ he wami nɛ lɛ hu e ma ya ye: Tsɛ be ɔ, moo lɛɛ o le kaa e pee we nɔ́ ko mohu, se lɛɛ e susuu kaa e sɛ nɛ a yeɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o ni lemi ɔ maa pee hɛ mi kpatami nɔ́ kɛ ha nyɛmi nɛ gbɔjɔ ngɛ mumi mi, nɛ e he Kristo ba gbo ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Nɛ ke o ha o nyɛmi pee nɔ́ ko nɛ e susu kaa e hi ɔ, o pee yayami kɛ si lɛ, nɛ yayami nɛ o pee kɛ si o nyɛmi ɔ, Kristo nɛ o pee kɛ si. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ja a he je ɔ, ke wɔhi a nya bɔ sami lo yemi ma ha ye nyɛmi maa pee yayami ɔ, lɛɛ i be yee gbleegbleegblee ngɛ ye wami si himi mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ko ha nɛ ye nyɛmi ɔ nane nɛ kpata.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo tsɔɔ e fiɛmi ɔ sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Bɔfo ji mi nɛ Mawu tsɔ, i be nɔmlɔ ko sisi. Ami lɛɛ i na Yesu wa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi kɛ hɛ mi; nɛ nyɛ si himi nɛ tsake ɔ ji nyɛ he dengme nɛ i gbo ɔ yiblii nɛ e wo kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Se ke ni komɛ bui mi kaa bɔfo ɔ, nyɛɛ lɛɛ i ji bɔfo kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa ye ni tsumi ɔ nɔ a gu kɛ kpɔ nyɛ kɛ ha Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Enɛ ɔ ji heto nɛ i ngɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ bi mi he blɔ nɛ i ngɛ ɔ hae.<verse eid="1CO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Anɛ i be he blɔ kaa i yeɔ ni nɛ i nuu kaa bɔfo kpa amɛ lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Anɛ i be he blɔ kaa i kɛ nyɛmiyo nɛ ji ye tsu nya yo hiaa blɔ kaa bɔ nɛ kaseli kpa amɛ kɛ nyɛmimɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi kɛ Petro peeɔ ɔ lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Anɛ i kɛ Barnaba kɛkɛ nɛ sa ni tsumi, konɛ nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ ha ni kpa amɛ a hiami nihi lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ta hwulɔ te nɔ nɛ woɔ lɛ nitsɛ e he hiɔ nɛɛ? Aloo ngmɔ hulɔ te nɔ nɛ kpaa ni ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ngmɔ nɔ se e be he blɔ nɛ e yeɔ eko nɛɛ? Aloo to lɛlɔ te nɔ nɛ ngɛ jijɔ kɛ apletsihi lɛe se e be he blɔ nɛ e nuɔ a nyɔ nyu ɔ eko nɛɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Tsa pi níhi nɛ nimli susuu ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɛ dee nɛ ma kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ́ nɛ da, se mohu i ngɛ nyɛ tue se tsɛe kɛ ba Mawu Mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ejakaa a ngma ngɛ Mlaa nɛ Mawu ha Mose ɔ mi ke, “Mo ko fi na nɛ ngɛ blɛfo gblɛe ɔ e nya kaa e ko ye eko.” Anɛ nyɛ susuu kaa nahi kɛkɛ a he nɛ Mawu de enɛ ɔ ngɛ lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Anɛ pi wɔ hu wa he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue lo? Wa he e ngɛ susue ɔ nɛ; nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli tsuɔ ni kɛ haa a, e sa nɛ a woɔ mɛ hiɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ huɔ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ hluɛɔ blɛfo ɔ, a hɛ nɛ hi nɔ́ kaa mɛ hu a maa ye eko.<verse eid="1CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Wɔɔ lɛɛ wa du mumi mi wu kpakpahi kɛ wo nyɛ klaahi a mi. Anɛ e ji nɔ́ ko nɛ he maa wa ha nyɛ tsɔ ke wa bi nyɛ niye ni kɛ tade lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Nyɛ kɛ haa nihi nɛ ba fiɛɛ kɛ haa nyɛ, nɛ e sa ja. Se anɛ e sɛ kaa wɔ hu wa naa eko nɛ hiɛ pe a nɔ́ ɔ tete po kɛ jee nyɛ ngɔ lo? Se kɛ ɔ, wa di kikɛmɛ a he blɔ nɛ ɔ se, nɛ wa tsuɔ wa hiami níhi a he ni, nɛ nyɛ yi kɛ bua we wɔ. Wa bi we hiɔ womi ko kɛ ji nyɛ ngɔ, ejakaa wa sume nɛ lɔ ɔ nɛ ba pee blɔ tsimi nɔ́ ko kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ko ba nya Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ he.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Anɛ nyɛ kai we kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsuɔ ni ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, Mawu de mɛ ke a ye nike ni ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ baa Sɔlemi We ɔ eko lo? Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsuɔ ni ngɛ Mawu bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ he ɔ, anɛ nyɛ kai we kaa mɛ hu a yeɔ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ nike ni ɔmɛ eko lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ Mawu to blɔ nya kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ fiɛɔ e Manye Munyu ɔ mɛ hu a na nɔ́ ko kɛ je ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ Munyu ɔ ye ɔ a dɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Se ami lɛɛ i bi we nyɛ pɛsua po hyɛ. Nɛ i be womi nɛ ɔ ngmae nɛ ma kɛ kai nyɛ kaa nyɛɛ pee kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ha mi. Anɔkuale ji kaa i ma suɔ nɛ hwɔ nɛ gbe mi pe nɔ nɛ i ma tsi bua jɔmi nɛ i naa ngɛ Munyu ɔ nɛ i fiɛɛ gu ɔ nya. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Nɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi pi fiami nɔ ko kɛ ha mi, ejakaa a kɛ fɔ ye nɔ kaa ma fiɛ. Kusiɛ ha mi ke i fiɛ we Manye Munyu ɔ!<verse eid="1CO 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Kaa ami nitsɛ ye suɔmi nya ni tsumi nɛ i ngɛ tsue jinɛ ma na hiɔwo ko kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ dɛ, se tsa pi ja i, ejakaa Mawu nɛ tsɛ mi nɛ e kɛ kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi klɔuu nɛ ɔ wo ye dɛ, nɛ i be nya jemi ko. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Mɛni ji ye hiɔwo ngɛ blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔ mi mɔ? Ye hiɔwo ji bua jɔmi nɛ i naa ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi mi, nɛ i he we nɔ́ ko ngɛ nɔ ko dɛ nɛ i dí ye blɔ nya nɔ ko hu se.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Enɛ ɔ he ngɛ se nami pɔtɛɛ ko, ejakaa i pee we nyɔguɛ kɛ ha we nɔ ko ngɛ hiɔwo nɛ e woɔ mi he. Se mohu i kɛ bua jɔmi pee ye he sɔmɔlɔ kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ konɛ ma nyɛ ma kpɔ mɛ kɛ ha Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ke i ya Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ngɔ ɔ, i peeɔ ye he Yuda no bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a bu Manye Munyu ɔ tue nɛ ye nine nɛ su a nɔ kɛ ha Kristo. Nɛ ke i su Hela bi ɔmɛ, nihi nɛ yeɔ Yuda bi a mlaahi kɛ kusumi ni peemihi a nɔ a ngɔ ɔ, e ngɛ mi kaa i kɛ mɛ kpa we gbi mohu, se i kɛ mɛ hwuɛ nɔ́ ko he, ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae ji ma ye kɛ bua mɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ja we Mawu ɔ, mɛ hu i kɛ mɛ hii si bɔ nɛ ma nyɛ; se i pee we nɔ́ ko nɛ kɛ Kristo jami ɔ sɔɛ. I kɛ mɛ kpaa gbi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a bua nɛ jɔ ye he nɛ ma nyɛ ma ye kɛ bua mɛ.<verse eid="1CO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />I pee we ye he ni lelɔ tsɔ ngɛ gbɔjɔli ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ ma de ke mɛɛ kuasiahi ji mɛ. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a suɔ kaa ma ye kɛ bua mɛ. Bɔ tsuaa bɔ nɛ nɔ ko ngɛ ha a, i bɔɔ mɔde nɛ i kɛ lɛ peeɔ kake bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma na he blɔ nɛ ma jaje Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ nɛ Kristo nɛ he e yi wami. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />I peeɔ enɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nine nɛ su Manye Munyu ɔ nɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ hu ami nitsɛ i naa jɔɔmi ke a ba Kristo ngɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dengme gbomi kɛ kunimi yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />A hiɛɛ fuu kɛ kaa fo, se nɔ kake too nɛ yeɔ hlami nɛ e naa jamɛ a blɔ he ɔ he nike ni. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ka fo ɔ konɛ nyɛɛ ye kunimi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Loko ji nyɛ maa ye kunimi ɔ, nyɛ kua nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ hiɔ níhi fuu nɛ maa tsi nyɛ blɔ ɔ. Fo tulɔ tsuaa fo tulɔ peeɔ enɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e nine nɛ su ayekoo nike ni nɛ se kɛ we nɔ. Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa tsuɔ wa ni tsumi ɔ konɛ wa nine nɛ su hiɔwe nike ni nɛ puɛ we ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ fo ɔ tue tɛɛ kɛ yaa nyagbe he ɔ kɛ oti ngɛ ye hɛ mi. I ngɛ kunɔ nɔe nɛ ma ye kunimi. Tsa pi kɔɔhiɔ nɛ i kɛ ngɛ nɔe, nɛ i fiɛ we hulɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />I gbaa ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nya nɛ i peeɔ lɛ basabasa nɛ i kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ nɔ́ nɛ sa nɛ e tsu, se pi e suɔmi nya i. I peeɔ enɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyagbe mi benɛ i bua fo mali ɔmɛ a nya ta a, a ko de ke ami lɛɛ i be he wami nɛ a ngmɛɛ ye he.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Mamimɛ suɔli, wa hɛ nɛ ko je nɔ́ nɛ ba wa tsɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ blema ko ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ nɔ; bɔ nɛ Mawu ha nɛ bɔ kuu nyɛɛ a hɛ mi kɛ po Wo Tsutsu ɔ kɛ manye ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Enɛ ɔ ngɛ kaa nɔ́ nɛ a baptisi mɛ ngɛ wo ɔ kɛ bɔ kuu ɔ mi kaa Mose se nyɛɛli, nɔ nɛ a ngɔ a he kɛ ha kaa a kpakalɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Nɛ Mawu gu nyakpɛ blɔ nɔ kɛ ha mɛ niye ni ngɛ nga a nɔ nɛ a ye. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Nɛ e ha mɛ nyu hu nɛ a nu. A nu nyu nɛ Kristo ha mɛ ɔ. Lɛ nitsɛ e ngɛ a kpɛti ngɛ mɛ he wami woe kaa Mumi mi tɛ sa ngua ko. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Se ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa se ɔ, a ti nihi fuu bui Mawu tue, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ nga a nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />A kɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ to wɔ okadi konɛ wa ko dí ni yayahi a se kaa mɛ; <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />nɛ wa ko ja wɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a pee ɔ. Ngmami ɔ deɔ wɔ ke, “Ni ɔmɛ ho hi si nɛ a ye ni nɛ a nu da nɛ a bɔni do fiɛmi” kɛ ngɛ na bi sika tsu ɔ jae.<verse eid="1CO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu a ngɛ wɔ dee ke, wa ko bɔ ajuama kaa bɔ nɛ a ti nihi kɛ ni kpahi a yihi pee, nɛ mɛ nihi akpe gbo ligbi kake ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Nɛ wa ko ka Nutsɔ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a ti ni komɛ ka lɛ hyɛ ha nɛ sinɔhi kɔ mɛ nɛ a gbo ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Nɛ nyɛ ko huhuɛ kɛ si Mawu kaa bɔ nɛ a ti ni komɛ pee nɛ lɔ ɔ he je Mawu ha e bɔfo ɔ ba kpata a hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ní nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa ba a nɔ nɛ a kɛ to wɔ okadi. A ngma mɛ kɛ to nɛ a kɛ bɔ wɔ kɔkɔ konɛ wɔ nihi nɛ je ɔ nyagbe ɔ na wɔ ta a, waa kase ni kɛ je mi.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ja a he je ɔ, mo nɔ nɛ o ngɛ susue kaa o be nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ pee ɔ, o hyɛ o he nɛ hi saminya nɛ enɛ ɔmɛ nɛ pee kɔkɔ bɔmi nɔ ha mo, ejakaa yayami ma nyɛ ba o nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Kami ko be nɛ bɛ Nɔmlɔ nɔ hyɛ. Kamihi ba nihi fuu a nɔ hyɛ, nɛ kami ko be nɛ nya hí dami. Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ he ngɔ fɔ Mawu nɔ nɛ e maa gbe kami tsuaa kami nya la bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ nya maa da. E wo he si nɛ e maa pee ngɛ e si womi ɔ nya. E maa tsɔɔ nyɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa pee kɛ je kami he wami ɔ mi konɛ nyɛ nyɛ nya nɛ nyɛɛ da. <verse eid="1CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mamimɛ suɔli, nyɛɛ hiɔ wɔ jami tsuaa wɔ jami.<verse eid="1CO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyɔ ɔ tsuo nya hí dami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Juɛmitsɛmɛ ji nyɛ, ja a he je ɔ, nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ kɔ nɔ́ nɛ ma de nɛ ɔ se kaa e ji anɔkuale sane lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Ke wa bi Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ e gbaa wai kplu ɔ nɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ okplɔɔ ɔ he ɔ, anɛ tsa pi Kristo muɔ ɔ e jɔɔmi ɔ nɛ wa pee kake kɛ ngɛ dlae ɔ lo? Nɛ ke wa ku abolo ɔ mi tsɔwitsɔwi nɛ wa pee kake kɛ ngɛ yee ɔ, e tsɔɔ we kaa wa pee kake kɛ ngɛ se nami nɛ ngɛ e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ɔ dlae lo? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Nimli abɔ nɛ ye ɔ he hia we. Si abɔ nɛ wɔ tsuo wa ye abolo kake ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa wɔ tsuo ɔ Kristo nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he níhi ji wɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ yeɔ bɔ sami ni ɔmɛ ɔ, a guɔ nɔ kɛ peeɔ kake.<verse eid="1CO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Kɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe kɛɛ ɔ? Pe i ngɛ dee ke wɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a saa bɔ kɛ haa a, a ngɛ wami, nɛ bɔ sami ɔ he ngɛ se nami lo? Dabi! <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ji kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ jali ɔmɛ saa a, mumi yayamihi a saa kɛ haa, se pi Mawu; lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i be suɔe kaa nyɛɛ bɔ huɛ kɛ gu bɔ sami niye ni nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Nyɛ be Nutsɔ ɔ kplu ɔ kɛ Abosiami kplu ɔ nya nyu nyɛe maa nu si kake. Ja a nɔuu kɛ nyɛ be Nutsɔ ɔ okplɔɔ ɔ nɔ abolo kɛ Abosiami nɔ́ ɔ nɔ ni nyɛe maa ye si kake. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Mɛni sane? Anɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi mi la nɛ nyɛ ngɛ woe lo? Anɛ nyɛ he wa pe lɛ lo? <verse eid="1CO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Nyɛ ngɛ he blɔ, ke nyɛ suɔ kaa nyɛ maa ye wɔ nya niye ni. Nyɛ tɔ we Mawu mlaa a nɔ ke nyɛ ye wɔ nya lo, se lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we hu kaa nyɛɛ ye. E da ngɛ mlaa nya mohu, se e pi nɔ́ nɛ hi, nɛ e be yemi kɛ buami nɔ́ pee kɛ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Nyɛ ko susu nyɛ nitsɛmɛ kɛkɛ nyɛ he, se mohu nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e susu e nyɛmi he kɛ nɔ́ nɛ maa hi ha lɛ.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Nyɛ he de lo tsuaa de lo nɛ a ngɛ juae ngɛ jua a nɔ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. Nyɛ ko bi si kaa wɔ nya lo i lo, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ he nile nɛ ko kojo nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ejakaa zugba a kɛ e nɔ ni kpakpa amɛ kulaa a, Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ́ i, nɛ a ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ye.<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ke nɔ ko nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ tsɛ nyɛ ni yemi nɛ nyɛ suɔ ɔ, nyɛɛ ya; nɛ nyɛɛ ye nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a kɛ maa ma okplɔɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ko bi he sane ko. Kɛkɛ ɔ, nyɛ be lee ke ji a kɛ sã bɔ kɛ ha wɔhi, konɛ nyɛ he nile nɛ ko kojo nyɛ kaa nyɛ ye wɔhi a nya niye ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Se ke nɔ ko wo nyɛ tue nɔ kaa wɔ nya bɔ sami niye ni i ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ko ye ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ de nyɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Tsa pi ngɛ nyɛ he, se ngɛ he numi nɛ nɔ nɛ wo nyɛ tue nɔ́ ɔ ma na ngɛ he ɔ he je.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Se nyɛ ma bi ke, Mɛni he je nɛ nɔ́ nɛ nɔ́ ko ma susu ɔ peeɔ ye kɔmɔ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ke ji i bi Mawu nɛ e gbaa niye ni ɔ nɔ ha mi nɛ ma ye ɔ, mɛni he je nɛ nɔ ko susumi nɛ e ma na kaa e sɛ nɛ ma ye ɔ tsiɔ ye niye ni ɔ nya. <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />E nya tsɔɔmi ji nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee ɔ, ni nɛ nyɛ ngɛ yee jio, ni nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nue jio, aloo nɔ́ kpa ko nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee jio, nyɛɛ pee kulaa kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="1CO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko pee blɔ mi tso kɛ ha nɔ ko, Yuda bi jio, Hela bi jio, Kristo se nyɛɛli jio. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Ami hu i yeɔ blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔ nɔ. Ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi ɔ, i bɔɔ mɔde kaa ma sa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ hɛ mi. I pee we nɔ́ nɛ i suɔ aloo nɔ́ nɛ hi ha ami pɛ, se mohu nɔ́ nɛ hi ha mɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a he a yi wami.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yihi a blɔ he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nyɛɛ kase mi kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i kase Kristo ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Mamimɛ suɔli, ye bua jɔ nyɛ he kaa nyɛ kai nihi nɛ i tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ peeɔ tsuo pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Se nɔ́ kake nɛ ma suɔ nɛ nyɛɛ le ji kaa yo e yi ji nyumu. Nɛ nyumu hu e yi ji Kristo, nɛ Kristo e yi ji Mawu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyumu ngɛ sɔlee aloo e ngɛ Mawu Munyu fiɛe nɛ pɛɛ ngɛ e yi ɔ, Kristo he guɛ nɛ e ngɛ gbee ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Nɛ yo nɛ sɔleɔ aloo e gbaa ngɛ magbɛ nɔ nɛ e fí duku ɔ, e huno he guɛ nɛ e ngɛ gbee ɔ nɛ. Ejakaa e yi nɔ fimi ɔ tsɔɔ kaa e ngɛ nyumu ɔ sisi. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ke ji yo sume kaa e ha e yi nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ e sɛ e yi ɔ. Se ke yi ɔ sɛmi hu ngɛ lɛ zo pee ɔ, lɛɛ e ha nɔ mɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Se nyumu lɛɛ ke e ngɛ sɔlee ɔ, e sɛ kaa e buɔ pɛɛ aloo e haa e yi nɔ, ejakaa e pɛɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa e ngɛ nimli a sisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:7">Mawu hɛ mi nyami ji nyumu nɛ e bɔ ngɛ e subai nɔ ɔ. Nɛ yo hu ji nyumu hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ejakaa pi yo mi nɛ a je kekle nyumu ɔ kɛ je, se kekle yo ɔ je nyumu mi. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Nɛ a bɔ Adam nɛ ji kekle nyumu ɔ ngɛ yo nɛ ji Hawa a he je, se Adam he nɛ a bɔ Hawa ngɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, yo maa ha e yi nɔ kɛ tsɔɔ okadi kaa e ngɛ nyumu sisi, nɛ e ji okadi kɛ ha hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ a bua jɔɔ he.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Se nyɛ kai kaa ngɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ nya a, nyumu he hia yo, nɛ yo hu he hia nyumu. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ejakaa kɛ je benɛ a je kekle yo kɛ je nyumu mi se ɔ, nyumuhi tsuo gu yo mi kɛ ba; se nyumu kɛ yo tsuo je Mawu nɛ ji a Bɔlɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ke nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ susuu ngɛ enɛ ɔ he kee? Anɛ e hi kaa yo nɛ e sɔle ngɛ magbɛ nɔ́ nɛ e he e yi nɔ lo? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Anɛ wa he nile tete tsɔɔ we wɔ kaa e sa nɛ yihi a ha a yi nɔ lo? Nyumu nɛ ngɛ yi bwɔmi gaga a, e peeɔ le zo. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Se yo nɛ ngɛ yi bwɔmi gaga a, e fiaa ngɛ he. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ke nɔ ko ngɛ hlae nɛ e je enɛ ɔ he nguane ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ ye nya ji, wɔɔ lɛɛ wa tsɔɔ we nɔ́ kpa ko pe enɛ ɔ, kaa yo nɛ e ha e yi nɔ ke e ngɛ Sɔlee, aloo e ngɛ fiee ngɛ ma he mi; nɛ Mawu asafo ɔmɛ kulaa hu suɔ ja.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nutsɔ Niye ni ɔ he sane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Nɔ́ nɛ piɛ nɛ i ma ngma nyɛ ngɛ he ji nɔ́ ko nɛ i kɛ nyɛ kpa we gbi ngɛ he. Ejakaa e peeɔ mi kaa ke nyɛ kpe ngɛ Nutsɔ Niye ni ɔ he ɔ, nɔ́ yaya mohu jee mi pe nɔ́ kpakpa. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />A deɔ mi nya sami kɛ mi gbamihi nɛ baa nyɛ kpɛti ke nyɛ kpe ɔ, nɛ i heɔ yeɔ fa kɛ fa. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />E peeɔ mi kaa nyɛ ngɛ susue kaa e sa nɛ mi gbamihi nɛ ba nyɛ kpɛti konɛ ni kpakpa amɛ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, a je a he si nɛ a le mɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ke nyɛ bua nyɛ he nya ngɛ he kake ɔ, pi Nutsɔ ɔ Niye ni ɔ yemi nɛ nyɛ ba, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />se nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ni yemi. Ejakaa i nu kaa nyɛ mlɛ we nyɛ bi. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ yeɔ ni ɔ mlamlaamla nɛ e susuu we e nyɛmi he; nɛ benɛ hwɔ ngɛ nɔ ko yee ɔ, e nyɛmi lɛɛ e nu da hluu nɛ e de. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Anɛ e ji anɔkuale sane lo? Anɛ nyɛ be we nɛ nyɛ maa ye nyɛ niye ni ɔmɛ ngɛ mi, nɛ nyɛ maa nu da a hu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ? Mawu asafo ɔ he guɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ gbee aloo nihi nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔmɛ a hɛ mi si nɛ nyɛ ngɛ puee lo? Mɛni sa kaa ma de ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a he? Nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ ma je nyɛ yi lo? Dabi! Enɛ ɔ lɛɛ i be nyɛ yi jee.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ de mi ngɛ e Niye ni ɔ he nɛ i kɛ ba ha nyɛ ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ: Nutsɔ Yesu ɔ, jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi nɛ Yuda tsɔɔ e se blɔ ɔ, e wo abolo, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />nɛ benɛ e na Mawu si ngɛ he ɔ, e ku mi nɛ e ngɔ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye. Enɛ ɔ ji ye nɔmlɔ tso nɛ a ku ha nyɛ. Nyɛɛ pee enɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ kai mi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ e wo wai kplu ɔ hu ngɛ Niye ni ɔ se nɛ e de ke, “Kplu nɛ ɔ ji somi he ngɛ nyɛ kɛ Mawu kpɛti nɛ a kɛ ye muɔ ɔ ma nɔ mi. Nyɛɛ pee enɛ ɔ si abɔ nɛ nyɛ maa nu ɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ kai mi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ejakaa be fɛɛ be nɛ nyɛ maa ye abolo nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ maa nu kplu nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Mawetsɛ ɔ gbenɔ sane ɔ fiɛe kaa e gbo ha nyɛ. Nyɛɛ hi enɛ ɔ pee kɛ ya si be nɛ e maa ba ekohu.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ yeɔ abolo nɛ ɔ nɛ e nuu Nutsɔ ɔ kplu ɔ ngɛ blɔ nɛ sɛ nɔ ɔ, e yeɔ Nutsɔ ɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ kɛ e muɔ ɔ he fɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ nɔmlɔ nɛ ka lɛ nitsɛ e he saminya nɛ e hyɛ ha loko ji e ye abolo ɔ eko nɛ e nu kplu nɛ ɔ eko. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ejakaa ke e ye abolo ɔ nɛ e nu kplu ɔ bɔ nɛ sɛ ɔ, Mawu kojomi mohu nɛ e ngɛ gblae kɛ ngɛ e nɔ́ fɔe, ejakaa e bui Kristo nɔmlɔ tso ɔ kɛ e gbenɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ he je nɛ nyɛ ti nihi fuu gbɔjɔ nɛ a ngɛ hiɔ nue, nɛ nihi fuu hu gbo ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Se ke nyɛ ka nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he saminya loko nyɛ ye ni ɔ, a be nyɛ kojoe, nɛ a be nyɛ tue gblae. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Se ke Nutsɔ ɔ kojo wɔ nɛ e gbla wa tue ɔ, e ji tsɔsemi kɛ ha wɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko bu wɔ kɛ je ɔ tsuo fɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mamimɛ suɔli, ke nyɛ bua nyɛ he nya ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ Niye ni ɔ he ɔ, nyɛɛ mlɛ nyɛ bi. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ke hwɔ ngɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko yee ɔ, e ye ni ngɛ we mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ko gbla kojomi kɛ fɔ lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ ke nyɛ tsuo nyɛ kpe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">I kɛ nyɛ maa sɛɛ ni kpa amɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ ke i ba su nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mumi ɔ dloomi nike ni pɔtɛɛ komɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, i suɔ nɛ ma tsɔɔ nyɛ Mumi mi dloomi nike nihi pɔtɛɛ nɛ a ha wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Nyɛ ma kai kaa loko a tsɛ nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ba plɛ Kristo nihi ɔ, nyɛ jaa wɔhi nɛ eko tui munyu. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ nihi ngɛ kpee nɛ a tsɛɔ a he Mawu Mumi mi gbali. Kɛ nyɛ maa pee kɛ le kaa Mawu nɛ tsɔ mɛ aloo lakpa nɛ a ngɛ yee kɛɛ? Nyɛ maa le mɛ kɛ gu a munyu tumihi a mi, ejakaa nɔ nɛ tuɔ munyu ngɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ mi ɔ, e gbiɛ Yesu, nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe ma de kɛ je e tsui mi ke Yesu ji Nutsɔ kaa ja Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɔ wo e nya.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Mawu dloo wɔ nike nihi slɔɔtohi kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu kake ɔ nɔuu nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Mawu sɔmɔmi ni tsumi slɔɔtohi ngɛ, se Nutsɔ kake ɔ nɔuu wa kɛ sɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Nɛ ni tsumihi slɔɔtohi hu ngɛ, se Mawu kake ɔ nɛ guɔ blɔ slɔɔtohi a nɔ kɛ tsuɔ ngɛ wa wami mi. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Nɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ jeɔ Mawu he wami ɔ kpo kɛ guɔ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɔ konɛ wa na he blɔ kɛ ye kɛ bua asafo ɔ tsuo.<verse eid="1CO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mumi ɔ dloo nɔ ko nile nɛ e kɛ haa ga womi; nɛ nɔ ko hu jamɛ a Mumi ɔ nɔuu dloo lɛ ni kasemi kɛ ni tsɔɔmi. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Jamɛ a Mumi ɔ nɔuu dloo nɔ ko hemi kɛ yemi titli ko, nɛ nɔ ko hu Mumi ɔ dloo lɛ hiɔ tsami he wami. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Nɔ ko lɛɛ Mumi ɔ dloo lɛ he wami nɛ e kɛ tsuɔ nyakpɛ nihi. A haa nɔ ko lɛɛ gbami kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi dloomi nike ni; nɔ ko hu a dloo lɛ mumihi a si kpami; nɔ ko ɔ, a dloo lɛ gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ e kase we hyɛ a tumi. Nɛ nɔ kpa hu a ha lɛ munyuhi a sisi tsɔɔmi dloomi nike ni ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Se dloomi nike ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu kake too ɔ nɔuu nɛ e kɛ haa wa ti nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ bɔ nɛ e suɔ.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kaa bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso kake se e hɛɛ he nihi fuu, nɛ he ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ peeɔ nɔmlɔ tso kake ɔ, ja a nɔuu ji Kristo Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, Yuda bi jio, Hela bi jio, nyɔguɛhi jio, odehehi jio, Kristo nɔmlɔ tso kake ɔ he níhi ji wɔ tsuo; nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu kake ɔ nɛ baptisi wɔ ngɔ wo Kristo Nɔmlɔ tso kake ɔ mi, nɛ e dloo wɔ kulaa jamɛ a Mumi ɔ nɔuu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ hɛɛ he nihi fuu. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ke nane ma de ke akɛnɛ e pi nine he je ɔ, tsa pi Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni ɔmɛ eko ji lɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa tsa pi nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he nɛ nane lɛɛ e ngɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Nɛ ke tue hu ma de ke akɛnɛ tsa pi hɛ ngmɛ ji lɛ he je ɔ tsa pi nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni ɔmɛ eko ji lɛ ɔ, anɛ lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa lɛɛ tsa pi nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he nɛ e ngɛ lo? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ke nɔmlɔ tso mluku ɔ kulaa ji hɛ ngmɛ ɔ, kɛ nɔmlɔ ɔ maa pee kɛ nu nɔ́ kɛɛ? Aloo ke nɔmlɔ tso mluku ɔ kulaa hine tue agbo kake too ɔ nɛɛ kɛ a maa pee kɛ nu nɔ́ he fu kɛɛ?<verse eid="1CO 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Se pi ja a nɛ Mawu bɔ wɔ. E bɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he nihi fuu nɛ e ngɔ eko tsuaa eko ngɔ ma nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he nɛ e suɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Kɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ maa hi kɛɛ, ke ji e ngɛ he nɔ́ mluguduu kake pɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a pee nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he nihi fuu mohu, se nɔmlɔ tso ɔ kake i. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Hɛ ngmɛ be nyɛe ma de nine ke, “I hla we mo.” Nɛ yi hu be nyɛe ma de nanehi ke, “I hla we nyɛ.”<verse eid="1CO 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni komɛ nɛ peeɔ kaa a he wɛ nɛ a he hia we ɔ, mɛ mohu ji níhi nɛ a he hiaa wawɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />E hi kaa wa ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni komɛ nɛ he be fɛu. Nɛ wa dlaa jamɛ a nɔmlɔ tso he nɔ́ ɔmɛ saminya nɛ a ko na. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Se níhi nɛ a he ngɛ fɛu nɛ a naa a, a hia we he dlami nɛ ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu to nɔmlɔ tso ɔ ngɛ blɔ ko nɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a wo hɛ mi nyami kɛ bumi kɛ ha e he nihi nɛ be fɛu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Enɛ ɔ ha we nɛ mi gbami baa he ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti, se mɛ tsuo a baa a si bi a yi. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ke nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni kake ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ, he ni ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ lɛ naa nɔ́. Nɛ ke a wo nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he ni ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake hɛ mi nyami ɔ, nɔmlɔ tso he ni ɔmɛ kulaa bua jɔɔ a he.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Jehanɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe ji, nyɛ tsuo ɔ, Kristo Nɔmlɔ tso kake ɔ he níhi ji nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ he hia. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Nɔmlɔ tso he ni ɔmɛ ekomɛ nɛ e ngɔ to asafo ɔ nɛ ji e Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nya ji: bɔfohi kɛ gbali, nihi nɛ fiɛɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ; tsɔɔli, nyakpɛ ni tsuli, nihi nɛ a dloo mɛ he wami kɛ ha hiɔ tsami, yemi ke buali, nihi nɛ a hyɛɔ ni tsuli a nɔ, nihi nɛ a tuɔ gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ pi a ya kase ngɛ he ko. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Anɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ji bɔfo lo? Dabi! Anɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ji Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛlɔ lo? Dabi! Anɛ nihi tsuo ji tsɔɔli lo? Anɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ he wami nɛ a kɛ tsuɔ nyakpɛ ni lo? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Anɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ he wami nɛ a kɛ tsaa hiɔ lo? Dabi! Anɛ Mawu dloo nɔ tsuaa nɔ he wami nɛ e kɛ tuɔ gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ e kase we gblee lo? Anɛ nɔ tsua nɔ nyɛɔ tsɔɔ gbi kpahi a sisi lo? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Dabi! Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛ nine nɛ su dloomi nike nihi nɛ he hia pe kulaa amɛ a nɔ. Se kekleekle ɔ, nyɛ ha ma tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ kpa ko nɛ hi pe kulaa.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nɔ́ ko nɛ kle pe kulaa ngɛ je ɔ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ke i tuɔ gbi kpahi nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ i kase we tete, se i be ni kpahi a he suɔmi ɔ, lɛɛ i ngɛ kaa ngmlɛ nɛ pɛɛ gu. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Nɛ ke a pee mi gbalɔ nɛ i le nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ i naa nɔ́ nɛ maa ba hwɔɔ se, nɛ i ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ma nyɛ ha yoku nɛ hia kɛ je he nɛ e ngɛ, se i be suɔmi ɔ, lɛɛ ye he be se nami ko kulaa. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nɛ ke i ngɔ ye nihi tsuo ngɔ ke ohiafohi, nɛ a sa ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ hɛ ngmengmle mi ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi he se i be suɔmi ɔ, i be he se ko nae.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Suɔmi mi jɔ nɛ e toɔ e tsui si. Suɔmi hɛ kɔɛ nɛ e ji hunga. Suɔmi wo we e he nɔ, nɛ e pee we pupuupu. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Suɔmi pee we níhi nɛ sɛ, e klɔɛ lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ́ mi, nɛ e wo we e nya nɔ ngɛ nɔ nɔ. Suɔmi hla we lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ́ se blɔ, e na we abofu, nɛ e kɛ nɔ tɔmi wui e mi. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Suɔmi nya we amimi yemi he, se mohu e nyaa anɔkuale he. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ke o ngɛ nɔ ko he suɔmi ɔ, o yeɔ lɛ anɔkuale ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi; o heɔ e nɔ yeɔ. O ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ e mi nɛ o fiɔ e se daa.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Gbami kɛ gbi slɔɔtohi a tumi se maa po, nɛ nile kɛ Mawu dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ he wami ɔmɛ kulaa a se maa po, se suɔmi se be poe gbleegbleegblee. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nɔ́ bɔɔ ko pɛ wa le kɛ wa dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ, nɛ nihi nɛ a dloo mɛ fiɛmi he wami ɔ, a fiɛmi ɔmɛ hu tete pi si. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Se ke a pee wɔ nɛ wa hi kɛ pi si ɔ, lɛɛ dloomi nike ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ sui ɔ, a se dimi se maa po.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Benɛ i ji jokuɛ ɔ, i tuɔ munyu kaa jokuɛ, nɛ i susuu nihi a he kaa jokuɛ. Se benɛ i wa nɛ i pee nyumu nɔkɔtɔma a, ye juɛmi nya wa pe jokuɛ mi juɛmi ɔ. Ja a he je ɔ, i sake jokuɛwi a ni peemi ɔmɛ ngɔ pue he. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ wa hyɛɔ Mawu, nɛ wa nuɔ Mawu sisi fa kɛ fa amlɔ nɛ ɔ, kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ lɛ hyɛe tsuu ngɛ ahuhuɛ nɛ mi tsɔ we mi. Se wa maa na lɛ kɛ pi si hɛ mi kɛ hɛ mi ligbi ko. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ i le ɔ, e mi tsɔ we, se jamɛ a ligbi ɔ lɛɛ ma na nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ paa kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu naa ye tsui mi kɛ pii si ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Níhi etɛ nɛ a se pui ji, hemi kɛ yemi, hɛ kɛ nɔ fɔmi kɛ suɔmi. Se a ti nɔ́ nɛ kle pe kulaa ji suɔmi.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Gbi slɔɔtohi a tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Nyɛɛ di suɔmi se nɛ nyɛ bi Mumi ɔ dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ hulɔ, titli ɔ, gbami kɛ Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ke nɔ ko tuɔ gbi kpahi nɛ pi kasemi nɛ e kase ɔ, e le kaa Mawu nɛ e kɛ ngɛ munyu tue se pi nimli, ejakaa a be sisi nue, akɛnɛ Mumi ɔ he wami nya e ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ngɛ, nɛ e ji laami mi munyu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nɔ nɛ gbaa nɛ e fiɛɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ, e yeɔ kɛ buaa nimli nɛ e woɔ mɛ he wami, nɛ e jɔɔ a bua konɛ a wa kɛ pi si ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ nɛ tuɔ munyu ngɛ gbi kpahi a mi ɔ, e yeɔ kɛ buaa lɛ nitsɛ e he, ejakaa lɔ ɔ haa e waa ngɛ Mumi ɔ mi. Se nɔ nɛ gbaa nɛ e fiɛɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ, lɛɛ e yeɔ kɛ buaa asafo ɔ nɛ e hi kɛ pi si ngɛ he tsɔmi kɛ bua jɔmi mi.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />I ko suɔ nɛ nyɛ tsuo nyɛ na gbi slɔɔtohi a tumi dloomi nike ni ɔ eko; se titli ɔ, gbami kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi dloomi ɔ, ejakaa nɔ nɛ gbaa a, e pe nɔ nɛ tuɔ gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ a nui sisi, ja e nyɛɔ tsɔɔ sisi nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ naa he se.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, ke i ba nyɛ ngɔ nɛ i ba tu munyu ngɛ gbi nɛ nyɛ nui sisi mi ɔ, mɛni se nyɛ ma na ngɛ he? Se ke i de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ Mawu je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi ɔ paa, loo nihi nɛ i le, loo nihi nɛ maa ba, loo Mawu anɔkuale Munyu ɔ, enɛ ɔmɛ ji níhi nɛ maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Kaa bɔ nɛ bɛ loo saku nɛ a fiaa a ngɛ ɔ, nɛ ke e pɛmi ɔ mi tsɔ we nɛ a nui sisi ɔ, ja a nɛ gbi nɛ a nui sisi ngɛ, ejakaa ke a ngɛ bɛ kpae aloo a ngɛ saku fiae nɛ e mi tsɔ we ɔ, nɔ ko be lee nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ kpae aloo nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ fiae. <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Nɛ ke sojahi a bɛ kpalɔ ɔ bɛ kpami ɔ mi tsɔ we ɔ, kɛ soja amɛ maa pee kɛ le kaa a ngɛ mɛ ta nga nɔ tsɛe kɛɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ ke nyɛ hu nyɛ tu gbi nɛ a nui sisi ɔ, nɔ ko be nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ dee ɔ sisi nue. Ke e ba mi ja a, lɛɛ nyɛ ngɛ kaa nɔ ko nɛ e kɛ gbogbo ngɛ munyu tue.<verse eid="1CO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Gbi slɔɔtohi fuu ngɛ je ɔ mi nɛ a he ngɛ se nami kɛ ha nihi nɛ nuɔ a sisi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Se a he be se nami kɛ ha mi, ejakaa ke nɔ ko kɛ mi ngɛ gbi nɛ ɔmɛ eko tue nɛ i nui sisi ɔ, e ma plɛ he kpa no ngɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ ami hu i peeɔ ma je no ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Si abɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Mumi mi dloomi ni ɔmɛ a se die ɔ, nyɛ bi níhi nɛ a he hia pe kulaa kɛ níhi nɛ maa ye kɛ bua asafo ɔ tsuo.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke a dloo nɔ ko nɛ e tuɔ gbihi nɛ a nui sisi ɔ, e sɔle nɛ e kpa pɛɛ konɛ a dloo lɛ nɛ e nyɛ nɛ e tsɔɔ nihi nɛ e deɔ ɔmɛ a sisi hulɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ejakaa ke i sɔleɔ ngɛ gbi nɛ i nui sisi mi ɔ, ye mumi ɔ sɔleɔ lɛɛ, se i li nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Lɛɛ kɛ ma pee kɛɛ? E sa nɛ ma pee ni enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo. Ma sɔle ngɛ gbi nɛ a nui sisi mi kɛ gbi nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nuɔ sisi mi. Ma la ngɛ gbi nɛ a nui mi, nɛ ma la ngɛ gbi nɛ a nuɔ sisi mi konɛ ma nyɛ nu Mawu yi jemi nɛ i ngɛ jee ɔ sisi. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ejakaa ke o kɛ mumi ɔ kɛkɛ ngɛ Mawu yi jee ngɛ gbi nɛ a nui sisi mi ɔ, kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ nihi nɛ nui nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ dee ɔ sisi ɔ maa piɛ o he kɛ je Mawu yi nɛ a na lɛ si kɛɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />E ngɛ mi kaa o ngɛ Mawu si nae saminya mohu, se o yi kɛ bua we nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />I naa Mawu si kaa i tuɔ gbi slɔɔtohi ngɛ laami mi pe nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Se ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi ɔ, ma suɔ kaa ma tu munyu kakaaka enuɔ pɛ nɛ a maa nu sisi nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua ni kpahi pe nɔ nɛ ma tu munyu akpe nyɔngma ngɛ gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ a nui sisi mi.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛ ko pee nyɛ he jokuɛwi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi numi mi. Nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he bimwɔwi ngɛ yayami peemi blɔ fa mi. Se ngɛ juɛmi blɔ fa mi ɔ, nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he juɛmitsɛmɛ nɛ nuɔ níhi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ a sisi. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Ejakaa a de wɔ ngɛ blema Ngmami ɔ mi kaa Mawu maa tsɔ nihi kɛ je zugba kpahi a nɔ kɛ ba nɛ a kɛ e ma a ba tu munyu ngɛ gbi slɔɔtohi a mi, se a be mɛ tue bue po. <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, gbi slɔɔtohi a tumi pi Mawu he wami okadi ha Mawu bimɛ. Se mohu e ji okadi kɛ ha nihi nɛ he we yi. Gbami nɛ ji Mawu Munyu ɔ e anɔkuale tluluu ɔ fiɛmi ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ he hia ni nɛmɛ nɛ he ye ɔ, se pi ni nɛmɛ nɛ he we yi. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ja a he je ɔ, ke nɔ nɛ he we yi aloo nɔ nɛ na we dloomi ni nɛ ɔmɛ eko ba sɔlemi nɛ e ba nu nɛ asafo mluku ɔ tsuo ngɛ munyu tue ngɛ gbi slɔɔtohi a mi ɔ, e ma susu kaa nyɛ ngɛ godo nue. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Se ke nyɛ ngɛ gbae nɛ nɔ ko nɛ he we yi aloo nyɛmi he ko ngɛ Kristo mi nɛ nui ni nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi ba je lejɛ ɔ, fiɛmi nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ma ha nɛ e he nile maa kojo lɛ nɛ e maa nu e he lo sisi kaa yayami peelɔ ji lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Nyɛ fiɛmi ɔ ma je e juɛmi mi laami níhi kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ paa nɛ e ma ha nɛ e kpla si ngɛ e nakutso nya nɛ e ja Mawu nɛ e ye odase kaa Mawu ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti niinɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami mi mlaahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Anyɛmimɛ, nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ji, ke nyɛ bua nyɛ he nya nɛ nyɛ ma ja Mawu, nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko ngɛ la ko, nɔ ko hu ngɛ tsɔɔmi ko, nɔ ko ngɛ Mawu sɛ titli ko kpo jemi, nɔ ko hu ngɛ gbi kpa ko tumi, nɛ nɔ ko hu ngɛ sisi tsɔɔmi ko ɔ, a pee ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo bɔ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ma ha e nane nɛ pi si ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ke nihi maa tu gbi slɔɔto kpa ko ɔ, a he nɛ ko hiɛ pe enyɔ loo etɛ, nɛ a tu kakaaka konɛ nɔ kpa ko hu nɛ tsɔɔ nɔ nɛ a ngɛ dee ɔ sisi. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Se ke sisi tsɔɔlɔ ko be lejɛ ɔ, a tu munyu ɔ zaa kɛ ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he kɛ Mawu nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko nu a nya.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Gbali enyɔ loo etɛ ɔ, a tu munyu ɔ kakaaka konɛ nihi nɛ piɛ ɔ a bu tue. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Se ke nɔ ko ngɛ gbae nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɔ ko na Mawu sɛ ko ɔ, gbalɔ ɔ nɛ jɔɔ munyu ɔ tumi. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nihi tsuo nɛ a dloo mɛ gbami ɔ ma na he blɔ nɛ a gba kakaaka konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kase nɔ ko kɛ ye kɛ bua e he. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Nyɛɛ le kaa ke gbalɔ ko ná Mawu sɛ ko ɔ, e ma nyɛ ye e he nɔ nɛ e be munyu tue kɛ ya si e maa su e nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ejakaa Mawu pi nɔ nɛ suɔ blɔ nya tomi nɛ ngɛ basabasa. Se mohu nɔ nɛ e suɔ ji kake peemi kɛ he jɔmi kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ a mi ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Yi ɔmɛ a ko tu munyu ngɛ asafo kpehi a mi. A ko ngmɛ mɛ blɔ nɛ a tu munyu ngɛ nihi a he sɛsɛmi mi, ejakaa a ngɛ nyumu ɔmɛ a sisi kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ke a ngɛ sane bimi ko ɔ, a bi a huno ɔmɛ ngɛ we mi, ejakaa e sɛ kaa yihi tuɔ munyu ngɛ asafo kpehi a mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Korinto bi, anɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mi kpa we gbi lo? Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ susue kaa nyɛ kɛkɛ nyɛ ngɔ nɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ ba nɛ nyɛ ngɔ e maa gbe nya ngɛ lo? Ke ja a, lɛɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he mlɔɔe. <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ke nyɛ ti nɔ ko buu e he kaa gbalɔ ji lɛ aloo a dloo lɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi níke nɔ́ titli ko ɔ, e sa nɛ e le kaa nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ, e ji kita nɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ dɛ mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Se ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ e kɛ mi kpa we gbi lolo ɔ, wa maa ngmɛɛ e he ngɛ e nɔ́ nɛ e li ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, nyɛɛ di gbami se, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ e mi nɛ tsɔ; nɛ nyɛ ko de ke gbi slɔɔtohi a tumi hi. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Se mohu nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ nɛ da ngɛ e blɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Manye Munyu ɔ mi oti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, anyɛmimɛ suɔli, i ngɛ nyɛ kaie kaa Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ i fiɛ kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ he ye nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ mi kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ, e tsakee we. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ nɔuu a kɛ ma he nyɛ yi wami ke nyɛ pɛtɛ he saminya kaa bɔ nɛ i fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ. Ke pi ja a, lɛɛ nyɛ he ye yaka gu.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Ejakaa munyu nɛ he hia pe kulaa nɛ a kɛ ha mi nɛ i ba de nyɛ ɔ ji kaa Kristo gbo ngɛ wa he yayami ɔmɛ a he kaa bɔ nɛ a de ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ; <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />nɛ a pu lɛ, nɛ a tle lɛ si ekohu kɛ je gbeje ngɛ ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ gba a. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />E je e he si ngɔ tsɔɔ Petro, nɛ pee se ɔ, e je e he si ngɔ tsɔɔ e kaseli “ni nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ” ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e je e he kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli pe lafa enuɔ ngɛ be kake mi. Jamɛatsɛ ɔmɛ a ti nihi fuu ngɛ, se ni komɛ hu gbo. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Yakobo na lɛ, nɛ pee se ɔ, bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo na lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Benɛ mɛ tsuo a na lɛ se ɔ, e je e he kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ ami hu kaa nɔ ko nɛ a je blɔ fɔ lɛ sekpɛ konɛ lɛ hu e na lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ejakaa nɔ wayo pe kulaa ji mi ngɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a kpɛti, nɛ i sɛ kaa a tsɛɔ mi bɔfo tete po ngɛ yi mi nɛ i wa Mawu asafo ɔ he je.<verse eid="1CO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Se ngɛ Mawu mi mi jɔmi kɛ e dloomi nya nɛ i ji nɔ nɛ i ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ e mi mi jɔmi kɛ e dloomi ɔ pee we yaka gu, ejakaa i tsu ni wawɛɛ pe bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo, nɛ tsa pi ami nitsɛ ye he wami nya ni tsumi i, se mohu Mawu nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ ye mi nɛ e kɛ wo ye hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Se slɔɔto ko be ami nɔ nɛ tsu ni wawɛɛ kɛ mɛ wa kpɛti, ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji kaa wɔ tsuo wa fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ nɛ nyɛ he ye.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Se ke nyɛ he nɔ́ nɛ wa fiɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ ye kaa a tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ti ni komɛ deɔ ke ni gbogboehi a si temi ko be ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ejakaa ke ni gbogboehi a si temi ko be ɔ, lɛɛ tse Kristo hu ngɛ gbeje kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ a tle we lɛ si mɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Nɛ ke a tle we lɛ si ɔ, lɛɛ se nami ko be wa fiɛmi ɔ he, nɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ ɔ hu peeɔ yaka gu; <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />nɛ wɔ bɔfo ɔmɛ hu wa peeɔ lakpatsɛmɛ, ejakaa wa ye odase kaa Mawu tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Se ke e ngɛ mi kaa ni gbogboehi a si temi ko be ɔ, lɛɛ a tle we Kristo hu si; <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />nɛ ke ja a, lɛɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi kaa Mawu ma he nyɛ yi wami ɔ peeɔ yaka, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hɛ mi kpatami ɔ mi ngɛ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a he kɛ sa. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Nɛ ke ja a, lɛɛ nihi tsuo nɛ gbo ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ hu laa. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Nɛ ke wami nɛ ɔ mi kɛkɛ wa hɛ ngɛ Kristo nɔ ngɛ ɔ, lɛɛ wa ni ngɛ mɔbɔ pe nihi kulaa nɛ a bɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Se anɔkuale ɔ ji Kristo te si kɛ je gbeje nɛ lɛ ji kekle nɔ nɛ te si ngɛ nihi nɛ maa te si kɛ je gbeje ligbi ko ɔ a kpɛti.<verse eid="1CO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ gbenɔ gu nɔ kake nɛ ji Adam nɔ kɛ ba je mi ɔ, ja a nɔuu si temi ɔ gu Kristo nɔ kɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Adam yayami ɔ he je nɛ nihi kulaa gboɔ ngɛ. Ejakaa Adam mi nɛ a je, nɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ yayami ngɛ ɔ, gbenɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Se nihi kulaa nɛ ngɔ a he kɛ ha Kristo ɔ, a ma tle mɛ si ekohu. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ e be. Kekleekle ɔ, Kristo te si. Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e maa kpale kɛ ba nɛ e ni ɔmɛ tsuo ma na wami ekohu ngɛ e bami ɔ mi.<verse eid="1CO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Enɛ ɔ se loko ji je ɔ nyagbe ɔ maa ba. Kristo maa ye he nyɛli kulaa a nɔ kunimi, nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ e maa ngɔ matsɛ yemi ɔ kɛ ha Tsɛ Mawu. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ejakaa Kristo maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya si be nɛ e maa ye e he nyɛli ɔmɛ kulaa a nɔ kunimi. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Nɛ nyagbe he nyɛlɔ ɔ nɛ e maa ye e nɔ kunimi ɔ ji gbenɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ejakaa Mawu ngɔ nɔ yemi kɛ níhi kulaa a nɔ he wami ngɔ wo Kristo dɛ. Se Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɔ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ yemi ngɔ ha lɛ ɔ, lɛɛ Kristo be e nɔ he wami. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ke Kristo ye e he nyɛli ɔmɛ kulaa a nɔ́ kunimi ɔ, lɛ nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ, e maa ngɔ e he kɛ wo Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɔ nɔ́ ɔmɛ ngɔ wo e dɛ ɔ sisi konɛ Mawu nɛ pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ yi.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ke ni gbogboehi be si temi ko ɔ, lɛɛ mɛni he je a baptisii nihi ngɛ ni gbogboehi a nane mi mɔ? Mɛni he je nihi haa a baptisii mɛ ngɛ ni gbogboehi a nane mi ke a be hɛ nɔ kami kaa a maa te si?<verse eid="1CO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Nɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ hu, mɛni he nɛ wa ngɛ amanehlu nae ngmlɛfia fɛɛ ngmlɛfia ngɛ mɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />E ji anɔkuale kaa i ngɛ gbenɔ hyɛe daa je nɛ maa na ngɛ ye hɛ mi, nɛ anɔkuale ɔ pɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ nɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ i fiaa kɛ fɔɔ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ngɛ wae ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ke se nɛ ma na ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ he je i ɔ, lɛɛ e sɛ nɛ i kɛ Efeso tsɛmɛ nɛ a ji lohwe dikali hwuɔ ta mɔ. Nɛ ke ni gbogboehi be si tee ɔ, lɛɛ tse wa ma de wa he ke nyɛ ha wa je wa hɛ ja, waa ye ni nɛ waa nu ni, ejakaa hwɔɔ ɔ wa ma gbo kɛkɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nya be.<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ nihi nɛ deɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a sisi nyɛ, ejakaa ke nyɛ bu mɛ tue ɔ, nyɛ hu nyɛ maa pee a ni peemi ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Nyɛɛ kase nile nɛ nyɛ kpa yayami peemi. I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee nɛ ma kɛ gbe nyɛ zo kaa nyɛ ti ni komɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa nɛ a li nɔ́ ko nɔ ko ngɛ Mawu he.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa hwɔɔ se nɔmlɔ tsohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Se eko ɔ, nɔ ko ma bi ke, “Kɛ ni gbogboehi maa pee kɛ te si kɛ je gbeje kɛɛ? Mɛni nɔmlɔ tso a ma kɛ te si kɛ ba?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Mɛni kuasia munyu ji enɛ ɔ! Ke o du dumi wu ɔ, e puɛ́ tso nɔuu, ja e “gbo” loko e yi naa wami. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Nɛ ke wu ɔ puɛ nɛ e je ba a, e slo lɛ ngɛ wu ɔ nɛ o du ɔ he. Ejakaa ngma wu loo dumi wu gbigbli kɛkɛ nɛ o du, <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />se Mawu haa wu ɔ tso nɛ e suɔ, nɛ ja a nɔuu e haa wu tsuaa wu e tso. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Kaa bɔ nɛ e slo wu tsuaa wu kɛ tso tsuaa tso ɔ, ja a nɔuu kɛ e slo nimli hu a he lo. E slo lohwehi a he lo, e slo nyu mi lohi a he lo, nɛ e slo lohwe pɛlitsɛhi a ní.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />E slo hiɔwe nɔmlɔ tsohi ngɛ wa nɔ́ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ e slo a he fɛu kɛ a hɛ mi nyami, ngɛ wa nɔ he. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />E slo pu hɛ mi nyami, nɛ e slo hlami hu hɛ mi nyami; nɛ e slo dodoehi a hɛ mi nyami. E slo dodoe kake he fɛu kɛ hɛ mi nyami ngɛ dodoe kpa he fɛu kɛ e hɛ mi nyami he.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ja a nɔuu kɛ e maa slo nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ wa ma kɛ te si ɔmɛ ngɛ nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ wa hɛɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ nɛ gboɔ nɛ saa amɛ a he. Ejakaa mɛɛ a be gboe hu. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Wa nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ wa hɛɛ piɔ ɔ nuɔ hiɔ nɛ a gboɔ; se a ma tle mɛ si ngɛ hɛ mi nyami mi. A gbɔjɔ nɛ a ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya, se ke a tle mɛ si ekohu ɔ, a ma na he wami saminya. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />A gboɔ kaa nɔmlɔ tsohi, nɛ a teɔ si kaa mumi mi nɔmlɔ tsohi. Ejakaa bɔ nɛ adebɔ mi nɔmlɔ tsohi ngɛ ɔ, ja a nɔuu nɛ mumi mi nɔmlɔ tsohi hu ngɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ngmami ɔ deɔ wɔ ke, Adam nɛ ji kekle nɔmlɔ nɛ a bɔ ɔ hɛɛ adebɔ nɔmlɔ tso, se Kristo lɛɛ e pe ja, ejakaa e hɛɛ mumi mi nɔmlɔ tso nɛ haa nɔ yi naa wami.<verse eid="1CO 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Lɔ ɔ ji kaa kekleekle ɔ, wa nine su adesa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ a nɔ loko Mawu ha wɔ mumi mi nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />A bɔ Adam kɛ zu, se Kristo lɛɛ hiɔwe nɛ e je. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Adesa tsuaa adesa hɛɛ Adam nɔmlɔ tso nɛ a bɔ kɛ zu ɔ eko pɛpɛɛpɛ, se nihi kulaa nɛ plɛ Kristo bimɛ ɔ, a maa hɛɛ Kristo nɔmlɔ tso nɛ je hiɔwe ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛɛ Adam nɔmlɔ tso amlɔ nɛ ɔ, ja a nɔuu kɛ wa maa hɛɛ nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ngɛ kaa Kristo nɔmlɔ tso hwɔɔ se ko.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Anyɛmimɛ, nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ji kaa, zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɔmlɔ tso nɛ hɛɛ he lo kɛ muɔ be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi nyɛe maa sɛ. Wa nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ puɛɔ nɛ ɔ pi nihi nɛ maa hi si kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Se i ngɛ nyɛ nyakpɛ laami sane nɛ ɔ dee ke, tsa pi wɔ kulaa nɛ wa ma gbo, se a ma ha wɔ tsuo nɔmlɔ tso he. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />E maa ba mi tlukaa ngɛ hɛ ngmɛfia mi, benɛ a ma kpa nyagbe tɛtlɛmatlɛ ɔ nɛ nihi nɛ gbo ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ maa te si tlukaa kɛ nɔmlɔ tso hehi nɛ be puɛe hu gbleegbleegblee. Kɛkɛ ɔ, wɔ nihi nɛ wa hɛ ngɛ ɔmɛ hu wa ma na nɔmlɔ tso hehi tlukaa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Nɛ wa zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ wa hɛɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ gboɔ ɔ, a ma plɛ mɛ hiɔwe nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ be puɛe se a maa hi si kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="1CO 15:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ke enɛ ɔ ba mi ɔ, kɛkɛ ɔ nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ maa ba mi kaa, “A ye gbenɔ nɔ kunimi.” <verse eid="1CO 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Mo gbenɔ, jije o kunimi yemi ɔ ngɛ? Mo gbeje, jije o kɛɛ ɔ ngɛ? Ejakaa yayami nɛ kɛ gbenɔ baa a be si hie hu, <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />nɛ mlaa nɛ jeɔ wa yayami ɔmɛ kpo ɔ be wɔ kojoe hu. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Se sina ha Mawu, nɔ nɛ ha wa ye kunimi kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, akɛnɛ nɔ mi mami ngɛ kaa wa maa ye kunimi ɔ, nyɛɛ da si kpɛii, nɛ nyɛ wlua nyɛ he ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ mi be fɛɛ be, ejakaa si abɔ nɛ si temi ngɛ ha gbogboehi nɛ ɔ, nyɛ dengme gbomi ɔ be yaka pee.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Onia tsumi kɛ ha Yerusalem asafo ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ sika nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsue kɛ maa mane Yerusalem asafo ɔ blɔ fa mi ɔ, nyɛ hu nyɛɛ nyɛɛ blɔ nya tomi nɛ i to kɛ ha Galatia asafo ɔmɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Daa Hɔgba a, nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ je nɔ́ ko kɛ je otsi hiɔwo nɛ e na a mi kɛ to nɛ e kɛ tsu onia a. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tsu onia a ngɛ bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ye kɛ bua lɛ nɛ e na a nya. Nyɛ ko mlɛ nɛ ma ba loko nyɛ tsu onia a. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Nɛ ke i ba a, i ma ngma womi kɛ piɛ nyɛ nike ni ɔmɛ a he kɛ ha tsɔli nɛ nyɛ suɔ kaa a wo nyɛ nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ ya Yerusalem ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nɛ ke e sa kaa ami hu ma piɛ a he kɛ ya a, i kɛ mɛ maa ya.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />I ma ya gu Makedonia, se ye se ya be kɛe ngɛ lejɛ ɔ loko ma ba slaa nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Eko ɔ, i ma hi nyɛ ngɔ be saii; nɛ eko ɔ, i ma ye fiɛ be ɔ hu ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ konɛ nyɛɛ wo mi blɔ kɛ ya he tsuaa he nɛ i ma ya a. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i be nyɛ slaae ngɛ si dami nya kɛkɛ. Ke Nutsɔ ɔ maa ngmɛ blɔ ɔ, i ma suɔ nɛ ma hi nyɛ ngɔ bɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Se i ma hi Efeso kɛ ya su Pentekoste He Jɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />A bli blɔ ko ha mi kɛ ha Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi kɛ ni tsɔɔmi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Ejakaa he nyɛli babauu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Ke Timoteo ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ e hɛ nɛ muɔ si, ejakaa e ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ni ɔ tsue kaa ami nɔuu. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nɔ ko nɛ ko nyange lɛ, nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko bu lɛ kaa jokuɛ nɛ a kua lɛ. Nɛ ke e ye e be ɔ ta a, nyɛɛ wo lɛ blɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ mane mi. I ngɛ lɛ kɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />I kpa wa nyɛmi Apolo pɛɛ hluu nɛ e ba slaa nyɛ, se e pee we lɛ kaa Mawu suɔ kaa e ba nyɛ ngɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Se e maa ba nyɛ ngɔ ke e na he blɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko je nyɛ he nɔ ngɛ oslaahi a he. Nyɛɛ da si kpɛii ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. Nyɛɛ pee nyumu nɛ nyɛ he nɛ wa. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Nɛ nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ suɔmi mi.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Anɛ nyɛ kai Stefana kɛ e we mi bi ɔmɛ lo? Mɛ ji Akaia kekle Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ a ngɔ a wami be ɔ kulaa kɛ ngɛ Kristo ni tsumi ɔ tsue, nɛ a ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli wae ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />I kpa nyɛ pɛɛ nɛ nyɛɛ bu mɛ tue, nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua mɛ kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ ngɔ a he kɛ ha ni tsumi ɔ nɛ a ngɛ dengme gboe ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />E ngɔ ye nya kaa Stefana kɛ Fortunato kɛ Akaiko ba slaa mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. A ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ mi buae ngɛ nyɛ nane mi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />A ba wo ye bua saminya nɛ a ha nɛ i na tsui. I heɔ yeɔ kaa ja a nɔuu nɛ a wo nyɛ hu nyɛ bua. I he ye kaa nyɛ bua jɔɔ ni tsumi nɛ kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ tsuɔ ɔ he.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Asia asafo ɔmɛ kulaa biɔ nyɛ. Akuila kɛ Priskila kɛ nihi nɛ peeɔ sɔlemi ngɛ a we ɔmɛ a mi ɔ kulaa biɔ nyɛ saminya. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Nyɛmimɛ ɔmɛ kulaa ngɛ hiɛ ɔ ke a biɔ nyɛ. Nyɛ nga nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ta nyɛ bi a dɛ mi kɛ suɔmi ke nyɛ kpe.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Ami nitsɛ nɛ i ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ nyagbe ɔ ngmae ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ sume Mawu ɔ, Jamɛatsɛ ɔ, gbiɛmi ngɛ e nɔ. Nutsɔ Yesu, ba! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo suɔmi ɔ kɛ e dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ nɛ hi si. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Yesu suɔmi ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si, ejakaa Kristo Yesu níhi ji wɔ tsuo.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>